<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Yaka - Nouveau Testament</book>
  <para style="toc3">Yow</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yowani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ndaa yimbwe yasonuu Yowani</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yowani</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndaa Yimbwe yasonuu Yowani, ni Ndaa Yimbwe yibali basonuu kwaa mabuundu ma Kristo makiba ku tsi ya Siria, so a buu pe, ku itinini kia Asia, ki bali mu uta lolo Turki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuulu yi mukaanda wu ali mu uduku, mandaa mali mutso nde, na tsuyili a nde, bili na lisoboso na mikaanda mikimi mia Ndaa Yimbwe. Mukaanda wu li mu uha ndutu, mu tsutulu a matsweeyi ma mandaa na biyiluu bia Yiisu.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ibari kia tsiomi kia mukaanda wu, (biiti <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1-12">1—12</ref></char>) ili mu uyaabisa bimaanga tsaamba biayiluu Yiisu. Bali mu uta mandaa maa <char style="em">biliimbi </char> mundaa ti mo mali mu ulaa ti Yiisu ni Mwaana a Nziaambi. Ibari ki ili mu utsuu ka mu mbwaanini a Yiisu na mukuutu wa Muyuudayo (kiiti<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3">3</ref></char>), na musi Samaria wa mukaasa (kiiti<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 4">4</ref></char>), na mbwaanini a nde na babeeri (kiiti<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 5">5</ref> </char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 9">9</ref></char>). Mu nziisili a nde, Yiisu li mu umonuu weti lipa lili mu uha moonyi. Nde li mu umonuu ka weti mukebi wuli mu ubiti baata kwaa Taata Nziaambi, na li liyalila lili mu uyalisa tsi yoosi. Mu yii, Yiisu li mu umweese kwaa boosi, nde na ali.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ibari kia bioolo, ili mu uyiluu na ili mu utsuu mu taanga di <char style="em">Yiisu afwaana usiisi tsi, mu uyene kwaa Taayi a nde</char>. Yiisu li mu utsuu kwaa miyii mia nde. Nde li mu uha bo mandoongi mundaa yatala, taanga di nde akaahele uba itwaari na bo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:16">13.16</ref></char>). Tumake Yiisu akuundi Nziaambi, Taayi a nde, na asuusi miyii mia nde nha mioo mia Nziaambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 17">17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mutata a mandaa mali mu uyaabisa likwa la Yiisu (kiiti<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 18">18</ref></char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 19">19</ref></char>), li na mandaa malaa mali mu uyene kuulu mosi, na mali mikaanda mikimi mia Ndaa Yimbwe yasonuu Mataayi, Malako, na Luka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu iluumbu kia mukuungi a Paaka, Yiisu amonii muutu wa moonyi kwaa miyii mia nde (biiti<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20-21">20—21</ref></char>). Yowani musonii a Ndaa Yimbwe yi, asonuu yo kwaa baata babahele umono Yiisu, paa bo ka bamene miaanzi mu nde (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:29-31">20.29-31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndaa Yimbwe yasonuu Yowani, yili mu utsuu kwaa Bayuudayo. <char style="em">Kaba la Bayuudayo</char> mu mukaanda wu, ni kaba la baata babali mitaata mia Yiisu wuli Kristo, weti bakuutu ba mabuundu bakitemenene nde. Yiisu nde makulu ali Muyuudayo, na bumosi ka kwaa miyii mia nde mia tsiomi. Mu taanga di Yowani ali mu utsuu mu Bayuudayo, nde a li mu utsuu pe ndila mu baata babali mu tsi a Bayuudayo. Ka nde li mu utsuu mu baata boosi babali mu ubisi Yiisu wuli Kristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndaa Yimbwe yasonuu Yowani, a yili mu utsuu pe mu mbutili a Yiisu, so mu mbaandila idiingi kia nde nha kulu a baata. Ka, mutso kotili yinda ya mukaanda, Ndaa Yimbwe yasonuu Yowani yili mu ubiindili ti, <char style="em">Yiisu Kristo li Ndaa a Nziaambi</char>. Ni ndaa yili mu uba na Nziaambi taanga dioosi, umatuu bele pe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1.1-18</ref></char>). Yiisu, Ndaa a Nziaambi, maayadiaala itwaari na baata. Mu nde, baata boosi utuu uba baana ba Nziaambi. Mu idiingi kia nde nha tsini a toto, Yiisu li akangama mu Taayi. Nde li <char style="em">wuu wu Taayi atsinduu</char> kwaa baata ba tsi. Boosi babali mu usaa uyaaba Nziaambi mu litoono, bo utuu uyaaba nde mu Yiisu wuli Kristo.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Ndaa ya liyalila na ya moonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Mu mbaandili mwali Ndaa, Ndaa yali na Nziaambi, na Ndaa yo makulu yali Nziaambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Mu mbaandili yo yali na Nziaambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Bioosi biayilimi mu yo, na a uli na iloo so imosi pe, kibayiluu kiayilimi kwahele a yo. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Mu yo mwali na moonyi, na moonyi wuu ali liyalila la baata. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Liyalila langeyini kutso pimisi, ka pimisi a diadimisi lo pe. <verse eid="JHN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Nziaambi atsindii muutu mu uyayaabisa Ndaa a nde kwaa baata, ni muutu wa kuumbu Yowani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Nde ayiri weti mbaangi, mu uta imbaangi mu liyalila lii, paa boosi basa imiini mundaa imbaangi kia nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Nde makulu a ali liyalila pe, ka nde ayiri mu uta imbaangi mu liyalila. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Liyalila li ali ni ndila lo limosi la ngwanya, lili mu uyiri mu tsi, na lili mu uyalisa baata boosi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Ndaa yali mu tsi. Tsi yayilimi mu yo, ka bunu tsi a yamuyaabi pe. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Yo yayiri mu tsi a baata ba yo, ka baata ba tsi yii a bayaki yo pe. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Ka kwaa boosi babayaki yo na babasi imiini mu kuumbu a yo, yo yahi bo muswa wa uba baana ba Nziaambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Bo a babutii baana ba Nziaambi mu musunyi na makili pe, so mu litoono la muutu pe. Ka bo babutii mu litoono la Nziaambi.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Ndaa yakitii muutu, na muutu wuu adiaali nha kati a bisi. Bisi diamoni buzitu ba nde, buzitu ba Mwaana ndila mosi wamata kwaa Taayi a nde. Nde ali aluulu mu bweese ba Nziaambi na mu ngwanya. <verse eid="JHN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yowani ati imbaangi mu nde. Yowani ayaabisi kwaa baata: «Ni mu nde me natsuyi bu naleeli: “Nde li mu uyiri ku mbisi a me, ka nde avulu me ndutu, mundaa ti nde akwiba tswaamina me ni butuu.”» <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Bisi boosi diayaki ikuku kia busini ba nde. Bisi diayaki bweese nha yulu a bweese. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Nziaambi ahi bisi mikele mu Mooso. Ka bweese na ngwanya biayiri mu Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Muutu so mosi pe wamaamono Nziaambi. Ka Mwaana ndila mosi, wuli mu udiaala nha peembi a Taayi, wamweesi bisi bu Taayi ali.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Imbaangi kia Yowani Mubootii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mataayi 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malako 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Bu bakuutu ba Bayuudayo ba ku ngaanda a Yeruselemi, batsindii kaba la bangaanga ba Nziaambi na Balevita, mu ufuulu Yowani: «We na li?» Mono mialeeli Yowani: <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Nde a abisi pe uha bo mvutu. Ka nde aleeli na yaki-yaki nha kulu a boosi: «Me a ndi Kristo pe.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Bo bamufuuli: «Ka we na li? We ni mubili Eliya?» Yowani avutili: «Ngori, me a ndi Eliya pe.» Bo babwileele: «We ni mubili wu bisi dili mu ukebe?» Nde abwivutulu: «Ngori, me a ndi mubili wuu pe.» <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Ka bo baleeli kwaa nde: «Ninha we na li? Bisi diafwaana uha mvutu kwaa babatsinduu bisi. We ima leeli mu we makulu?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yowani avutili: «Me ni muniingi a wuu wuli mu uloo ku tsi ya tsata:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Diyiluu Pfumu kuulu yayiluu usuungunu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Yes 40.3</ref></char></note>!”»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">Weti bwaleeli mubili Yeesaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Baata babatsindii kwaa Yowani bali Bafarisi. <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Bo babwifuulu nde: «Mbiiti we a li Kristo pe, so mubili Eliya pe, na so mubili wuu pe, ka mu ima we li mu ubootuu baata?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yowani wabavutili: «Me ni bootu beni mu maamba. Ka nha kati a beni, uli na muutu wu beni diahele uyaaba. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Ni nde wuu wuli mu uyiri ku mbisi a me. Ka me a nafwaana pe so hoolo mu unyangila midi mia bikoori bia nde.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Mandaa maa moosi makilabuu ku Betania, ku simi li limosi la nziali, ya kuumbu Yorodaani, ku Yowani akibootuu.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu mwaana a limeme la Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Iluumbu kiaduki, Yowani amoni Yiisu mu uyiri kwaa nde. Nde aleeli: «Dimono mwaana a limeme la Nziaambi, lili mu umaasa masumu ma baata ba tsi. <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Mu nde me natsuyi bu naleeli: “Muutu li mu uyiri ku mbisi a me, ka nde avulu me ndutu, mundaa ti nde akwiba tswaamina me ni butuu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Me a nali nayaaba nde pe. Ka me nayiri mu ubootuu mu maamba, paa me yaabisa nde kwaa baata ba Iseraeli.» <verse eid="JHN 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Yowani abwileele ta imbaangi: «Me namono Muheebili a Nziaambi mu usutuu, umatuu ku yulu weti beembe, na ahami mu uba itwaari na nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Me a nakiyaaba pe nde na ali. Ka Nziaambi, watsinduu me mu ubootuu mu maamba, aleeli kwaa me: “Muutu wu we kaamono Muheebili mu usutuu na uba na nde, ni nde kaabootuu baata mu Muheebili wa Ngira.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Me maamono Muheebili mu usutuu nha yulu a nde, na ngwanya me ndi mbaangi ti nde ni Mwaana a Nziaambi.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbili a miyii mia Yiisu mia tsiomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Mu iluumbu kiaduki, Yowani ali keni nhaa, na mioolo mu miyii mia nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Bu nde amoni Yiisu mu uyoo, nde aleeli: «Dimono limeme la Nziaambi!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Miyii mia Yowani mioolo miayuyi mandaa maa, na mio miaduki Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yiisu asieetii, na amoni ti bo bali mu uduku nde. Nde wabafuuli: «Ima beni dili mu usaa?» Bo bamuleeli: «We kuni li mu udiaala, Rabi?» Mambiindili ma Rabi, «Muyiisi». <verse eid="JHN 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa bo: «Yirani, na sa dimono.» Bo bayeni na bamoni ku nde akidiaala. Na bo bayoosi iluumbu kii itwaari na Yiisu. Helape ali ka nguungu ya mana ku mbisi a nzanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Andere, mwaana a nguu a Simooni Peetero, ali mosi mu baboolo babayuyi mandaa ma Yowani, na baduki Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Tsiomi a tsiomi, Andere ayimono mwaana a nguu a nde Simooni. Nde wamuleeli: «Bisi dimaamono Mesiya.» Mambiindili ma Mesiya, «Kristo». <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Tumake nde abiti Simooni kwaa Yiisu. Yiisu wamumoni na aleeli: «We ni Simooni mwaana a Yowani. Sa baha we kuumbu ya ubili “Kepasi.”» Mbiindila kuumbu yii, «Manya».<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ati Filipo na Natanaeli mbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Iluumbu kiaduki, Yiisu aholi kesili ya uyene ku Ngalili. Nde abwaanini na Filipo, na wamuleeli: «Duku me!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filipo ali musi Betesayida, ni ngaanda ka ya Andere na Peetero. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Nha mbisi, Filipo abwaanini na Natanaeli, na wamuleeli: «Bisi dimaamono wuu wu Mooso atsuyi mu Mukaanda wa Mikele, na wu mibili ka miatsuyi. Ni Yiisu, mwaana a Yoosefi, wa ku ngaanda a Nazareti.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanaeli wamuleeli: «Ndaa yimbwe utuu umata ku ngaanda a Nazareti?» Filipo wamuvutili: «Yiri, na we sa mono.»<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Bu Yiisu amoni Natanaeli mu uyiri kwaa nde, nde aleeli mu ndaa Natanaeli: «Mono musi Iseraeli wa ngo nde. A uli na ndaa ya pia mu nde pe.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanaeli wamufuuli: «Buni we yaabi me?» Yiisu avutili: «Me namono we nha tsini a muti wa mufiike, tswaamina Filipo uta we mbili.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Ni mu buu, Natanaeli wamuleeli: «Muyiisi, we ni Mwaana a Nziaambi wa ngwanya, we mutini a Iseraeli!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «We nha siiri imiini mu me, mundaa ti me ndeeli kwaa we ti me namono we nha tsini a muti wa mufiike? We sa mono mandaa mamavulu maa-na-ma mu bunene!» <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Na nde abwileele: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: beni sa dimono mayulu madibini, na batumu ba Nziaambi mu uhaata na usutuu nha yulu a Mwaana a muutu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Mba 28.12</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:13-14">Dan 7.13-14</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Makweele ku ngaanda a Kaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Nha mbisi a biluumbu bioolo, ali na mukuungi a makweele ku ngaanda a Kaana, mu itinini kia Ngalili. Nguu a Yiisu ali nhaa. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Ali bakuungi ka Yiisu na miyii mia nde ku makweele me.<verse eid="JHN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Mu taanga di mala mawi, nguu a Yiisu wamuleeli: «Bo ka mala pe.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Ka Yiisu wamuvutili: «Maama, we ima li mu usaa mu me? Taanga dia me keni a diafwaana pe.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Nguu a Yiisu aleeli kwaa basiali: «Disa mioosi mi nde uleele kwaa beni.» <verse eid="JHN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Ali na masaanga masamina ma bayiluu mu mamanya, ma Bayuudayo bakisalila mu matsaa ma tsieemini. Mu pasi lisaanga ali utuu ukoto iteesi kia kama a baliitre ba maamba. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa basiali: «Diluusu masaanga ma mu maamba.» Bo baluusi mo tee mu minywa. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Ni mu buu, Yiisu wabaleeli: «Ditee mwaana a ndaamba a maamba ma, na dibiti mo kwaa mubiti a mukuungi.» Bo bayilii buu.<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Mubiti a mukuungi abiimbi maamba mamakitii viinyi. Nde a ayaabi pe kuni mala maa mamati, ka basiali babateyi maamba bayaabi ku mo mamati. Ni mu buu nde ati mukweeli mbili, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>na wamuleeli: «Baata boosi koo ubaanduu uha mala mavulu bubwe. Tumake, bu babata mbili bamaanywa kwalaa, sa baha bo mala mahele ubweeye. Ka we, maaswee mala ma mabwe tee mu taanga di!» <verse eid="JHN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Mono, imaanga kia tsiomi kiayilii Yiisu ku Kaana, mu itinini kia Ngalili. Nde abaandii umweese buzitu ba nde, na miyii mia nde miasi imiini mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, nde ayeni ku ngaanda a Kapernawumi na nguu a nde, na baana ba nguu ba babaala, na miyii mia nde. Bo badiaali kuu mu ndila mwaana a biluumbu hoolo.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu mutso nzo a Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mataayi 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Malako 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Mukuungi a Bayuudayo wa Paaka ali ka bebele, ni buu Yiisu ayeni ku ngaanda a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Ku nzo a Nziaambi, nde amoni baata bakiyaluu bangoombo, bindombo na mabeembe. Nde amoni ka baata bakisoomboso mboongo badiaala nha mameese ma bo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Ni mu buu, nde ayilii ikoti mu misiingi, na abingi bo boosi ku mbari a nzo a Nziaambi, na bangoombo ba bo, na bindombo bia bo. Tumake, nde atsiali mboongo dia basoombisi nha tsi, na abuundili mameese ma bo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Tumake Yiisu aleeli kwaa bayalii a mabeembe: «Dimaasa bi bioosi nha! A dikitisi nzo a Taayi a me pe mu uba nzo a mumbungu!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Miyii mia nde mialibili moonyi mu mandaa maa mu Mabasonuu ma Ngira: «Oo Nziaambi, litoono li me ndi na lo mu nzo a we, lili mu unyeengese me weti mbaa.» <verse eid="JHN 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Ni mu buu, bakuutu ba Bayuudayo bamufuuli: «Ki imaanga we utuu usa mu umweese bisi ti we na muswa wa uyiluu mandaa ma pili yii?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa bo: «Ditsala nzo a Nziaambi yiinayi, na mu biluumbu bitata me sa bwatuungu yo.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Bo bamuleeli: «Imaa? Babatuungi yo basi bilimi maku-mana na bisamina. Ka we, we sa bwatuungu yo mu biluumbu bitata?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Ka <char style="em">nzo a Nziaambi</char> yi Yiisu akitsuu mu yo, ali nyutu a nde makulu. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Ni mu buu, mu taanga di Yiisu asiimbii mu babakwa, miyii mia nde mialibili moonyi ti nde aleeli buu. Na bo basi imiini mu Mabasonuu ma Ngira na mu mandaa ma Yiisu aleeli.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ayiluu uyaaba mitimi mia baata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Bu Yiisu ali ku ngaanda a Yeruselemi mu taanga dia mukuungi a Paaka, babalayi basi imiini mu kuumbu a nde, bu bakimono bimaanga bi nde akiyiluu. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Ka Yiisu a asi mutimi mu bo pe, mundaa ti nde ayaabi bo boosi bubwe-bubwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Nde a ali na nzala pe ti bayaabisa nde ndaa so mosi, mundaa ti nde makulu ali ayaaba matsimi ma mitimi mia baata.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Liyolo la Yiisu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Ali na muutu mosi nha kati a Bafarisi, kuumbu a nde Nikodemo. Nde ali mosi mu bakuutu ba Bayuudayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Butsuu bumosi nde ayiri ku uyamono Yiisu na wamuleeli: «Muyiisi, bisi diayaaba ti Nziaambi atsinduu we mu uyayiisi bisi. Mundaa ti muutu pe wu utuu uyiluu bimaanga weti bu we li mu uyiluu bio, so Nziaambi a ali na nde pe.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nileele we: muutu pe wu utuu umono Ipfumu kia mayula so nde a butii pe libutuu lilinyatii.»<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodemo wamufuuli: «Buni muutu wakulu utuu ubwabutuu? Nde utuu ubwavutuu mu moonyo a nguu a nde na ubutuu mbala ya dioolo?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nileele we: muutu pe wu utuu ukoto mu Ipfumu kia Nziaambi so nde a butii pe libutuu la mu maamba na la mu Muheebili. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Kiabutuu mu musunyi ili musunyi, na kiabutuu mu Muheebili a Nziaambi, ili muheebili. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>A kimuu pe bu me ndeeli we: “Beni boosi diafwaana ubutuu libutuu lilinyatii.” <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Mupepe uyene ku nde atoono, we li mu uyuu kele yi nde ali mu usa. Ka we a ayaaba pe kuni nde ali mu umata, na kuni nde ali mu uyene. Mono bu ili mu uba kwaa pasi muutu wu ubutuu mu Muheebili a Nziaambi.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodemo wamufuuli: «Buni mii mituu uyilimi?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «We wuli muyiisi wa mvuungu mu Iseraeli, we a ayaaba pe mandaa maa? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Ee-e, ngwanya me nileele we: bisi dibaatsuu mu mandaa ma diayaaba, na dibaata imbaangi mu mandaa ma bisi diamono. Ka beni a dibaasingi pe imbaangi kia bisi. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Me maatsuu kwaa beni mu mimili mu ulabuu nha tsini a toto nha, na beni a diasa imiini mu me pe. Aka buni beni disa me imiini so me tsuyi beni mu mimili mu ulabuu ku mayula? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Muutu pe wahaati ku yula, so a ndila Mwaana a muutu pe wamati ku yula mu usutuu nha tsi! <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Mbii bu Mooso abandii taari nha muti mu tsi ya tsata<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">taari nha muti mu tsi ya tsata </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Lit 21.9</ref></char></note>, ni buu ka Mwaana a muutu afwaana bamunaangila. <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>Paa pasi muutu wu usa imiini mu nde, abaa moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Ka mbii bu Nziaambi atooni tsi, nde aheeri Mwaana a nde ndila mosi, paa pasi wu usa imiini mu nde, a budusu pe, ka sa abaa moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Nziaambi a atsindii pe mwaana a nde nha tsi mu ufuundusu tsi. Ka paa ti tsi iyobuu mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Wu usa imiini mu kuumbu a Mwaana, a bufuundusu pe. Ka wu uhele usa imiini mu kuumbu a Mwaana, bamaakwafuundusu nde. Mundaa ti nde a asi imiini pe mu kuumbu a Mwaana ndila mosi wa Nziaambi. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Mono buli pfuundisi: liyalila limaayiri nha tsi, ka baata batooni pimisi nha mbuu ya liyalila, mundaa ti biyiluu bia bo bili bibibi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Pasi wu uyiluu mamabi beli liyalila, na takii na lo. Mundaa ti nde li na boomo ti biyiluu bia nde bibibi biyabina nyanga-bala. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Ka wu ubaayiluu mandaa ma ngwanya ubaayiri ku liyalila. Paa bamono na yaki-yaki ti, mandaa ma nde ali mu uyiluu mali masuungunu na Nziaambi.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yowani mubootii ahi buzitu kwaa Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yiisu na miyii mia nde bayeni ku itinini kia Yuuda. Nde adiaali kuu taanga hoolo na bo, na nde akibootuu baata.<verse eid="JHN 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Yowani ka akibootuu ku bula ba kuumbu Enoni, bebele na Salimi, mundaa ti maamba ali mavululu kuu. Baata bakiyiri kwaa nde, na nde akibootuu bo. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Mu taanga dii, Yowani ali keni a balooso pe nde mu perese.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Babamosi mu miyii mia Yowani bakiyolo na Muyuudayo mosi, mu ndaa matsaa ma tsieemini. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Bo bayeni kwaa Yowani na bamuleeli: «Muyiisi, muutu wali na we ku simi li limosi la Yorodaani, wuu wu we ati imbaangi mu nde, mono nde li mu ubootuu! Baata boosi bali mu uyene kwaa nde!» <verse eid="JHN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yowani wabavutili: «A uli na muutu pe wu utuu ubaa iloo so imosi, mbii ti Nziaambi a ahi nde kio pe. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Beni bame dili bambaangi ti me naleeli: “Me a ndi Kristo pe, ka me batsinduu nha kulu a nde.” <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Mu mukuungi a makweele, baala lilibaakweele mukaasa, ni nde mulumi a mukaasa wuu. Nduu a mulumi koo utemene nha peembi a nde, mu uyuu nde. Nde koo aluulu mu kinyi, mu uyuu muniingi a mbaayi a nde wumaakweele. Kinyi yii ni yili na me, na yo yimaakuu mu taanga di. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Nde afwaana uyoo nha kulu, na me nha mbisi.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>«Muutu wamata ku yula, li nha yulu a baata boosi. Ka wuli wa nha tsi, li wa tsi, na li mu utsuu mandaa ma tsi. Muutu wamata ku yula [li nha yulu a baata boosi]. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Nde li mu uta imbaangi mu mi nde amoni, na mi nde ayuyi. Ka muutu pe wuli mu usiingi imbaangi kia nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Wu usiingi imbaangi kia nde, siingi ka ti Nziaambi li wa ngwanya. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Muutu wu Nziaambi atsinduu li mu uleele mandaa ma Nziaambi, mundaa ti Nziaambi li mu uha nde Muheebili a nde woosi. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Taayi atoono Mwaana, na nde asuusu bioosi nha tso mioo mia Mwaana. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Muutu wu usa imiini mu Mwaana, bayi moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. Ka wu ubisi usa imiini mu Mwaana, a ubaa moonyi wuu pe, ka Nziaambi sa aba na kesi a nde.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Liyolo la Yiisu na musi Samaria wa mukaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1-3"/>Bafarisi bayuyi ti Yiisu ali na miyii mialaa, na akibootuu baata kwavulu Yowani. Mu uyiluu umono, Yiisu nde makulu a akibootuu pe, ka miyii mia nde miakibootuu. Yiisu bu ayuyi mabakileele, nde amati ku itinini kia Yuuda, na avutii ku itinini kia Ngalili. <verse eid="JHN 4:1-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Mu uto ku Ngalili, toono nde ataba itinini kia Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Nde atoori bebele na ngaanda a Samaria mosi, ya kuumbu Sikare. Ngaanda yii, ali bebele na itsuru kia tsi ki Yaakobi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">itsuru kia tsi ki Yaakobi </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Mba 33.19</ref></char></note> ahi kwaa mwaana a nde Yoosefi. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Nhaa, mwali na idunu kia maamba kia Yaakobi. Bu nyutu yalemi Yiisu mu ndaa midieenge, nde adiaali nha peembi a idunu. Ali ka helape nguungu ya nzanga.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Musi Samaria mosi wa mukaasa ayiri ku uyatee maamba, na Yiisu wamuleeli: «Ha me maamba ma unywa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Mu taanga me dii, miyii mia nde miali miayeni ku ngaanda, mu uyasuumbu bia udia. <verse eid="JHN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Musi Samaria me wuu aleeli kwaa Yiisu: «We Muyuudayo li! Buni we utuu uloombo maamba kwaa me, musi Samaria?» Mukaasa aleeli buu mundaa ti, Bayuudayo a bubaayuhusunu pe na basi Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «So we ali ayaaba bungori ba Nziaambi anhana uha kwaa we, na so ali ayaaba wuli mu uloombo we maamba ma unywa, we akeni uloombo nde maamba. Nde keni uha we maamba ma moonyi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Mukaasa wamuvutili: «Taata, we a li na ipaayi pe, na idunu ili na musundu. Kuni we utuu ubaa maamba ma moonyi maa? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>We avulu kaa a bisi Yaakobi waha bisi idunu ki? Nde makulu anywi maamba ma kio, baana ba nde na biboori bia nde ka bianywiiri mo.» <verse eid="JHN 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Pasi muutu wu unywa maamba ma, sa abwabaa nyooto a maamba. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Ka muutu wu unywa maamba ma me niha nde, a ubwaba na nyooto a maamba so hoolo pe. Maamba ma me niha nde, sa maba idia kia maamba kili ukanya pe, sa mabaapalanga mu nde natee mu moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Mukaasa wemuleeli: «Taata, ha me maamba maa, paa me nyaala ubwabaa nyooto a maamba. Na, paa me nyaala ubwayiranga nha mu uyatee maamba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yiisu wamuleeli: «Yene, ta mulumi a we mbili, na yiravutuu nha.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Mukaasa wamuvutili: «Me a ndi na mulumi pe.» Na Yiisu wamuleeli: «We tsuyi ngwanya, bu we leeli ti we a li na mulumi pe. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Mundaa ti, we ali na balumi bataana, na baala li we li na nde mu taanga di a ali mulumi a we pe. Mu yii, we ngwanya leeli.»<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Ni mu buu mukaasa wamuleeli: «Taata, me ndi mu umono ti we mubili a Nziaambi we li. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Bakaa ba bisi basi Samaria bakuundi Nziaambi nha yulu a mulaanda wu. Ka beni Bayuudayo, beni dibaaleele ti mbuu yi bafwaana ukuundu Nziaambi ku Yeruselemi yili.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Ka Yiisu wamuvutili: «Maama, sa imiini mu ndaa yi, taanga dili mu uyiri, di beni a dibwakuundu pe Taata Nziaambi, so nha yulu a mulaanda wu, so ku Yeruselemi. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Beni basi Samaria dibaakuundu Nziaambi kwahele a uyaaba nde. Bisi Bayuudayo dibaakuundu nde na diayaaba nde, mundaa ti liyobolo lamata kwaa Bayuudayo. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Ka taanga dili mu uyiri, na dio diamaakwato. Taanga di bakuundi ba ngwanya bakaakuundu Taayi, mu Muheebili na mu ngwanya. Mundaa ti ni bakuundi ba pili yii Taayi ali mu usaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Nziaambi Muheebili ali, na ba bukuundu nde, bafwaana ukuundu nde mu Muheebili wuli mu ubiti ku ngwanya.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Mukaasa wamuleeli: «Me nayaaba ti Mesiya, wu bubaata Kristo, sa ayiri. Nha nde akaayiri, nde sa ayiisi bisi mandaa moosi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Me ni Kristo, me wu li mu utsuu na we.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Mu taanga dii, miyii mia Yiisu miayiravutuu. Bo bakimii mu umono nde mu utsuu na mukaasa. Ka bunu, so mosi pe wamufuuli: «Ima we li mu usaa?» so a buu pe: «Ki ndaa we li mu utsuu na nde?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Ni mu buu, mukaasa asiisi lisaanga la nde, na avutii ku ngaanda, ku ayileele kwaa baata: <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«Diyamono muutu wu maaleele me mandaa moosi ma me nayiluu. Helape nde ni Kristo!» <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Ninha, baata bapali mu ngaanda, na bayeni kwali Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Mu taanga dii, miyii miakihama mu uloombo kwaa Yiisu: «Muyiisi, dia mwaana a iloo!» <verse eid="JHN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Ka nde wabavutili: «Me ndi na biloo bia udia, bi beni diahele uyaaba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Miyii miafulisini bo na bo: «Na muutu wumaabee nde bia udia?»<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «Biloo bia me, ni uyiluu litoono la watsinduu me, na umana isala ki nde aha kwaa me. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Baata bubaaleelanga: “Batsuungi bana bamaasala, na sa diba taanga dia ukukuu.” Ka me nadileeli, diyiluu umono matsiee: mbutu dimaayele na diamaayilimi paa bakukuu dio. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Wu ukukuu maakwayaka mufutu a nde. Nde li mu ukukuu mbutu paa aswee dio mu moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. Ni mu buu, mukuni na mukukii sa bayaanga mu itwaari. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Mundaa ti, ngwanya baata bubaaleelanga ti: “Muutu mosi ubaakunu, mukimi ubaakukuu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Me natsinduu beni mu ukukuu mutso tsiee yi beni diahele umono pasi. Babamosi bamoni pasi mu yo, na beni dibayi ndaanda mu isala kia bo.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Basi Samaria babalayi mu ngaanda yii, basi imiini mu Yiisu, mundaa imbaangi kia mukaasa waleeli: «Nde leeli me mioosi mi me nayiluu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Ni mu buu, mu taanga di basi Samaria bayiri kwaa nde, bo bamuloombi mu udiaala na bo. Na Yiisu adiaali nhaa biluumbu bioolo. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Baata babasi imiini babwivululu bulayi, mundaa mi Yiisu nde makulu akileele. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Bo bakileele kwaa mukaasa: «Mu taanga di, bisi a dili mu usa pe imiini mu ndila ma we leeli kwaa bisi, ka mundaa ti bisi bame dimaayuu nde, na bisi dimaayaaba ti nde ni Muvuuyisi a baata ba tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu abeelisi musiali a mukuutu a masodaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Nha mbisi a biluumbu bioolo, Yiisu ayeni ku Ngalili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Yiisu nde makulu ali akwileele: «A bali mu uta imbaangi kwaa mubili mu tsi a nde makulu pe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat 13.57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mlk 6.4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk 4.24</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Ka, mu taanga di nde atoori ku Ngalili, baata ba itinini kii bayaki nde bubwe. Bo bamoni mioosi mi nde ayilii ku Yeruselemi mu taanga dia mukuungi a Paaka. Mundaa ti bo ka ali bayeni ku mukuungi wuu.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Ninha, Yiisu avutii ku ngaanda a Kaana mu itinini kia Ngalili, ku nde akitisi maamba viinyi. Ku ngaanda a Kapernawumi, kwali na musiali a mutini, wali na mwaana wa baala wali na ubeele. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Bu nde ayuyi ti Yiisu maamata ku itinini kia Yuuda, na maato ku Ngalili, nde ayimono Yiisu na wamuloombi mu uyene ku Kapernawumi itwaari na nde. Nde ayilii buu, paa Yiisu ayabeelese mwaana a nde, wali nha peembi a likwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yiisu wamuleeli: «So beni a dimoni biliimbi bia ukimuu na bimaanga pe, beni a dituu usa imiini so hoolo pe.» <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Musiali a mutini wamuvutili: «Pfumu, yiri ku nzo a me tswaamina mwaana a me ukwa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yiisu wamuleeli: «Vutuu ku nzo a we, mwaana a we sa aba moonyi.» Taayi a mwaana wuu, asi imiini mu mi Yiisu aleeli nde, na avutii ku nzo a nde. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Bu nde akiyiravutuu, mu taanga di basiali ba nde bayibwaana nde, na bamuleeli: «Mwaana a we maabeeluu!» <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Nde wabafuuli mu ki taanga mwaana a nde abeelii, na bo bamuvutili: «Aba matsii, mu nguungu ya tsiomi nha mbisi a nzanga, nha baa lawa nde.»<verse eid="JHN 4:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Taayi a mwaana alibili moonyi ti, ni mu nguungu yii, Yiisu aleeli kwaa nde: «Mwaana a we sa aba moonyi.» Ni mu buu nde asi imiini mu Yiisu, nde na kaanda la nde loosi. <verse eid="JHN 4:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Kii ali ni iliimbi kia bioolo ki Yiisu ayilii. Nde ayilii kio ku Ngalili, nha mbisi a umata ku Yuuda.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu abeelisi muutu wabobo binama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yiisu ayeni ku Yeruselemi ku mukuungi a Bayuudayo. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Mu ngaanda yii, mwali na ikotili kia kuumbu «Ikotili kia Mameme». Nha peembi a ikotili kii, mwali na bipaangala bitaana biadiengelele idia kibubaata «Betezata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Betezata </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwaa Baebeleo, mambiindili ma kuumbu yi: «Nzo a Bweese». </char></note>» kwaa Baebeleo. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Mutso bipaangala bii, ali na koongi a babeeri: bingima-ngimi, bangaa bitonzo na bababobo binama. [Bo bakikebe ti maamba manyingini. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Mundaa ti taanga dikimi, tumu a Nziaambi akisutuu mutso idia na akinyingisi maamba. Mubeeri watsiomi wu ubwa mu idia, nha mbisi a nha bamaanyingisi maamba, nde ubeeluu mu ibeeri kia nde, so ibeeri kii ibeeri so a buni.]<verse eid="JHN 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Ali nhaa na baala limosi lali na ibeeri, umatuu bilimi maku matata na pwoombo. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yiisu amoni nde ala nha tsi. Bu nde ayaabi ti nde ali mubeeri umatuu taanga dialaa, Yiisu wamufuuli: «We atoono ubeeluu?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Mubeeri wuu wamuvutili: «Pfumu, me a ndi na muutu pe wu utsindili me mutso idia, nha maamba mali mu unyingini. Mu taanga di me nisaa ubwa muu, muutu mukimi amaakwasutuu.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yiisu wamuleeli: «Temene, holo ikala kia we, na yene.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Nhaa-na-tsi, baala lii labeelii. Nde aholi ikala kia nde, na ayeni. Ka mandaa maa moosi makiyilimi mu iluumbu kia saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Ni mu buu bakuutu ba Bayuudayo baleeli kwaa baala labeelii: «Lolo iluumbu kia saba, mikele a mili mu uha we muswa pe mu ubiti ikala kia we.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Nde wabavutili: «Wubeelisi me, maaleele kwaa me bu: “Holo ikala kia we, na yene.”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Ni mu buu, bo bamufuuli: «Na maleele we: “Holo ikala kia we, na yene”?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Ka baala labeelii a ayaabi wamubeelisi pe, mundaa ti Yiisu akoti kutso koongi yali nhaa, na a abwimonuu pe.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yiisu abwaani nde mutso lipaanga la nzo a Nziaambi, na wamuleeli: «Mono! We maabeeluu mu taanga di. A bwasa masumu pe, paa ndaa yavulu bubi yinyaala ubwiilili we.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Tumake, baala lii layileele kwaa bakuutu ba Bayuudayo ti, ni Yiisu muutu wabeelisi nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Ni mu buu, bo babaandii ukwaamisa Yiisu, mundaa ti nde ayilii mandaa maa mu iluumbu kia saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Ka Yiisu wabaleeli: «Taayi a me li mu usala taanga dioosi, na me ka ndi mu usala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Mu ndaa a ndaa yii, bakuutu ba Bayuudayo babwisaa mu iteesi kiavululu mu udusu Yiisu. Bo bali na kesi a nde. Mundaa ti nde a akiinzi pe mukele a saba, na mundaa ti nde aleele ka ti Nziaambi li Taayi a nde. Mu mandaa maa, nde akimweese ti nde li iteesi mosi na Nziaambi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taayi aha litu loosi kwaa Mwaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Yiisu abwileele kwaa bo: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: Mwaana a utuu uyiluu ndaa so mosi pe mu inde makulu. Nde uyiluu ndila ma ali mu umono Taayi mu uyiluu. Moosi ma Taayi ali mu uyiluu, Mwaana ka li mu uyiluu bumosi. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Mundaa ti Taayi atoono Mwaana, na li mu ulaa nde bioosi bi nde makulu Taayi ali mu uyiluu. Nde sa wamulaa bisala biabwavulu biinabi mu bunene, na beni sa dikimuu. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Ka, weti bu Taayi ali mu usiimbili babakwa, na li mu uha bo moonyi, bumosi ka Mwaana li mu uha moonyi kwaa wu nde atoono. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Na Taayi a li mu ufuundusu muutu pe, ka nde aha kwaa Mwaana litu loosi la ufuundusu. <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>Nde aha mwaana litu loosi la ufuundusu, paa boosi baha buzitu kwaa Mwaana weti bu bali mu uha buzitu kwaa Taayi. Wu uhele uha buzitu kwaa Mwaana, a li mu uha pe ka buzitu kwaa Taayi watsinduu nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: pasi wu uyuu mandaa ma me, na siiri imiini mu watsinduu me, bayi moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. A bufuundusu nde pe, ka nde mata ku likwa, na nde ka moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: taanga dili mu uyiri, na dio diamaakwato, di babakwa bakaayuu muniingi a ndaa a Mwaana a Nziaambi, na babuyuu nde sa baba moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Mundaa ti, weti bu Taayi ali na moonyi mu inde makulu, bumosi ka nde aha muswa kwaa Mwaana mu uba idia kia moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Na nde aha kwaa Mwaana nde litu la ufuundusu baata, mundaa ti nde li Mwaana a muutu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>A dikimuu pe, mundaa ti taanga dili mu uyiri, di boosi babakwa bali mu mangili, bakaayuu muniingi ndaa a Mwaana a muutu. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Bo sa bapala mu mangili ma bo. Babayilii mandaa ma mabwe sa basiimbuu mu ubaa moonyi. Ka babayilii ma mabi sa basiimbuu mu uyaka tsieembili. <verse eid="JHN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>Me a nituu pe uyiluu ndaa so mosi mu ime makulu. Me ndi mu ufuundusu weti bu Nziaambi ali mu uleele kwaa me. Pfuundisi a me yili yasuungunu, mundaa ti me a ndi mu usaa pe uyiluu mi me natoono, ka litoono la watsinduu me.»<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Babali mu uta imbaangi mu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>«So me teeri imbaangi mu nyutu a me makulu, imbaangi kia me a kiafwaana pe. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Ka uli na muutu mukimi wuli mu uta imbaangi mu me, na me nayaaba ti imbaangi ki nde ali mu uta mu me, ili kia ngwanya. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Beni diatsinduu batumu kwaa Yowani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yowani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yowani wububaata Mubootii</char></note>, na nde teeri imbaangi mu ngwanya. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Me a ndi na nzala pe ti bata imbaangi mu me. Ka mbiiti me ndi mu uleele beni buu, paa beni diyobuu. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yowani ali weti mwiindi wu bali mu unamisa paa ayalisa. Beni diatooni uyaanga mu liyalila la nde mu mwaana a taanga hoolo. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Ka me ndi na imbaangi mu me, kiavulu bunene na imbaangi kia Yowani: bisala bi Taayi aha me mu ukuusu. Bisala bi me ndi mu usa bi, bili mu uta imbaangi mu me. Bio bili mu umweese ti Taayi atsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Na Taayi watsinduu me, li mu uta ka imbaangi mu me. Ka beni a diayuyi ndaa a nde so hoolo pe, na keni a diamono kiinzi kia nde pe. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Mandaa ma nde a mali mu udiaala pe mu beni, mundaa ti beni a dili mu usa pe imiini mu wu nde atsinduu. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Beni dili mu uyii Mabasonuu ma Ngira mu bungeele boosi, mundaa ti beni dili mu utsimi ti beni sa dibaa moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi mu mo. Ka bunu, ni mo mali mu uta imbaangi mu me! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Bunu, beni a diatoono pe uyiri kwaa me mu ubaa moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>Buzitu ba me a bali mu umata pe kwaa baata. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Ka me nayaaba beni, na me nayaaba ti beni a dili na litoono mu Nziaambi pe. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Mbiiti muutu mukimi yiri mu kuumbu a nde makulu, beni sa diamuyaka. Ka me nayiri mu kuumbu a Taayi a me, na beni dili mu ubisi uyaka me. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Buni beni dituu usa imiini? Beni ba dibaayaka buzitu ba beni bana mu bana, na a dili mu usaa pe buzitu bali mu umata kwaa Nziaambi nde makulu. <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Ka a ditsimi pe me sa fuundu beni kwaa Taayi a me. Ka Mooso kaafuundu beni, Mooso wu beni diasa ilimbisi mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>So beni diali diasa imiini mu Mooso, beni diakeni usa ka imiini mu me, mundaa ti nde asonii mu ndaa me. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Ka so beni a disiiri imiini pe mu ma nde asonuu, buni beni disa imiini mu mandaa ma me ndi mu uleele?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu na miyii mia nde bahi bia udia kwaa koongi yinene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mataayi 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malako 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yiisu ayeni ku simi li limosi la diaanga la Ngalili, libakita ka diaanga la Tiberiade. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Koongi a baata yinene yakiduku nde, mundaa ti baata bakimono biliimbi bia kimikimi bi nde akiyiluu mu ubelisa babeeri. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yiisu ahaati nha mulaanda na adiaali kuu na miyii mia nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Mukuungi a Bayuudayo wa Paaka, ali ka bebele.<verse eid="JHN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Bu Yiisu asiimbili misi na amoni ti koongi a baata yinene yakiyiri kwaa nde, nde afuuli Filipo: «Kuni bisi dituu usuumbu mapa malaa mu uha bia udia kwaa baata ba boosi?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Yiisu ali aleeli buu mu ukete Filipo, mundaa ti Yiisu ali akwayaaba mi nde anhana usa. <verse eid="JHN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipo wamuvutili: «So mu makama moolo ma mikuti mia mboongo, a dituu pe usuumbu mapa mamukuu bo boosi, paa mosi na mosi mu bo abaa mwaana a itsuru.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Wu mu mosi mu miyii mia nde, Andere, mwaana a nguu a Simooni Peetero, aleeli kwaa nde: <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Nha na nha uli na mufuru a baala wuli na mapa mataana ma oreze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mapa mataana ma oreze </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mapa mahele na tala yalaa, mapa ma bawele. Oreze yafwaanina na fariine ya bele.</char></note> na batswi boolo. Ka mwaana a bii, ima bituu usa nha kulu a koongi a baata ba boosi?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yiisu aleeli ti baata boosi badiaala. Ali na bitiiti bialaa nha mbuu yii, ninha baata badiaali nha tsi. Litaanga la babaala ali utuu uto mafuundu mataana. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yiisu aholi mapa, na nha mbisi a uvutulu matoono kwaa Nziaambi, nde akabi mo kwaa babali nhaa. Bumosi ka, nde abwiha bo batswi weti bu bo bali batoono. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Mu taanga di bo boosi badiiri mu tsitsi a yuutu la bo, Yiisu aleeli kwaa miyii mia nde: «Ditolo bitsuru bisiaali, paa ti iloo so imosi inyaala udiimbili.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Bo batoli bio, na baluusi mapwooyi kuumi na moolo mu bitsuru biasiaali mu mapa mataana ma oreze, ma baata badi.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Baata bu bamoni iliimbi kiayilii Yiisu, baleeli: «Mu ngwanya, wu ni mubili waba wafwaana mu uyiri nha tsi!» <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Yiisu ali ayaaba ti bakeni uyaholo nde mu mifuri, mu usuusu nde aba mutini a bo. Ni mu buu, nde abwiyene ku yulu a mulaanda, nde bake.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu adiaati nha yulu a mukaanda a maamba mu uyabwaana miyii mia nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mataayi 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Malako 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Tsitsii bu yatoori, miyii mia Yiisu miasutii ku mukoo a diaanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Bo bakoti mu bootu mu usabuu diaanga na uyene ku ngaanda a Kapernawumi. Butsuu ali bumaato, na Yiisu ali keni a ayiri pe mu uba itwaari na bo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Maamba ma diaanga makinyingini mundaa ti ali na iteembi kia mifuri. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Miyii ali miamaatakuu na simi, mu iteesi kia bakilometre bataana so a buu pe basamina. Mu taanga di bo bamoni Yiisu mu udiaata nha yulu a mukaanda a maamba ma diaanga, mu uyiri kwaa bo, bo babayi boomo balaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Ka Yiisu wabaleeli: «Ni me wa me, a diba na boomo pe!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Miyii miasiayi ulooso nde mu bootu, ka nhaa-na-tsi, bootu batoori ku bo bakiyene.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Mu iluumbu kiaduki, baata boosi babali basaala ku simi la diaanga li limosi bayaabi ti, nhaa mwali na ndila bootu limosi. Baata bayaabi ti Yiisu a akoti pe itwaari na miyii mia nde mu bootu lii, ka miyii mia nde miayeni mio bake. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Ka mabootu makimi mamakimata ku ngaanda ya Tiberiade, matoori bebele na mbuu yibadiiri mapa, nha mbisi a likuundu la Pfumu la mvutili a matoondo. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Mu taanga di baata bamoni ti Yiisu na miyii mia nde a bali nhaa pe, bo bakoti mu mabootu maa, na bayeni ku ngaanda ya Kapernawumi mu uyasaa nde.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ni lipa la moonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Bo bayibaasa Yiisu ku simi la diaanga lilikimi, na bamuleeli: «Muyiisi, mu ki taanga we toori nha?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Ee-e, mu ngwanya me nadileeli: beni dili mu usaa me, a mundaa pe ti, beni dimaayiluu uyaaba tsutulu a biliimbi bia kimi-kimi bi me nzilii. Ka beni dili mu usaa me, mundaa ti beni didiiri mapa mu tsitsi a yuutu la beni. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>A disala pe mundaa biloo bibifuu. Ka disala mundaa biloo bibidiingi, na bili iteeli kia moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. Biloo bii, Mwaana a muutu sa wadiha bio, mundaa ti Nziaambi, Taayi, anaa nha yulu a nde iliimbi kia litumu la nde.»<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Bo bamufuuli: «Ima bisi diafwaana usa mu ukuusu bisala bi Nziaambi atoono?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Isala ki Nziaambi asaa kwaa beni, ni usa imiini mu wuu wu nde atsinduu.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Bo bamuleeli: «Ki iliimbi we utuu umweese kwaa bisi, paa bisi disa imiini mu we? Ima we usa? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Bakaa ba bisi badi mapa ma maane mu tsi ya tsata, weti buli mu uleele Mabasonuu ma Ngira: “Nde wabaheeri mapa mamamati ku yula<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Pal 16.4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Mkg 78.24</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: a Mooso pe ahi beni lipa lamati ku yula, ka Taayi a me li mu uha beni lipa la ngwanya lili mu umata ku yula. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Mundaa ti lipa la Nziaambi, ni wuu wuli mu umata ku yula, na wuli mu uha moonyi kwaa baata boosi ba nha tsi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Bo bamuleeli: «Pfumu, baahaanganga bisi lipa lii taanga dioosi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Me ni lipa la moonyi. Wu uyiri kwaa me a ubwaba na nzala pe, na wu usa imiini mu me a ubwaba na nyooto pe. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Ka weti bu me nadileeli: beni dimaamono me, ka bunu beni a dili mu usa imiini pe. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Pasi nde mu baa ba Nziaambi ali mu uha kwaa me, sa ayiri kwaa me, na me a nibaabingi pe wu uyiri kwaa me. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Mundaa ti me a namati pe ku yula mu uyiluu litoono la me makulu, ka mu uyiluu litoono la watsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Na mono bwatoono watsinduu me: me nyaala udiimbisi so mosi mu ba nde aha kwaa me. Ka me siimbili bo mu babakwa mu iluumbu kia tsieelele. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Ee-e, mono bwatoono Taayi a me: boosi babali mu umono Mwaana, na babali mu usa imiini mu nde, babaa moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi, na me siimbili bo mu babakwa mu iluumbu kia tsieelele.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Bayuudayo basiiri Yiisu saa mundaa ti nde aleeli: «Me ni lipa lamati ku yula.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Bo bakileele: «Wu a ni Yiisu pe, mwaana a Yoosefi? Bisi diayiluu uyaaba taayi a nde na nguu a nde. Buni, mu taanga di nde utuu uleele ti: “Me namati ku yula.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Dinyaala unhunhunyu nha kati a beni. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Muutu pe wu utuu uyiri kwaa me so Taayi watsinduu me a tiiri nde mbili pe. Na, me sa siimbili nde mu babakwa mu iluumbu kia tsieelele. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Mibili miasonii mandaa ma: “Nziaambi sa ayiisi bo boosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Yes 54.13</ref></char></note>.” Ni mu buu, pasi muutu wuli mu uyuu Taayi, na wuli mu uyaka nziisili a nde, li mu uyiri kwaa me. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Muutu pe so mosi wamaamono Taayi, ka ndila wamata kwaa Nziaambi amono Taayi. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: wu usa imiini mu nde, li na moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi.<verse eid="JHN 6:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>«Me ni lipa la moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Bakaa ba beni badiiri maane ku tsi ya tsata, na bo bamaakwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Ka lipa lili mu umata ku yula, lili ti muutu wu udia lo, a ukwa pe. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Me ni lipa la moonyi limati ku mayula. So muutu diiri lipa li, nde sa aba moonyi taanga dioosi. Lipa li me niha paa tsi yiba moonyi, ni nyutu a me.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Mu ndaa yii, Bayuudayo bakaami kwa mifuri bo na bo. Bo bafuuli: «Buni muutu wu utuu uha bisi nyutu a nde mu udia?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yiisu avutili: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: so beni a didiiri pe nyutu a Mwaana a muutu, na so beni a dinywiiri makili ma nde pe, beni a diba na moonyi mu beni pe. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Mundaa ti muutu wu udia nyutu a me, na wu unywa makili ma me li na moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi, na me sa namusiimbili mu babakwa mu iluumbu kia tsieelele. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Mundaa ti nyutu a me yili biloo bia ngwanya, na makili ma me mali bia unywa bia ngwanya. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Ni mu buu, wu udia nyutu a me, na unywa makili ma me sa aba mu me, na me ka sa ba mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Taayi watsinduu me li moonyi, na me ndi moonyi mu nde. Bumosi ka, wu udia nyutu a me, sa aba moonyi mu me. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Ka mono lipa limati ku yula. Lo a lili pe weti ladi bakaa ba beni, babakwi. Ka wu udia lipa li, sa aba moonyi mu taanga dioosi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yiisu aleeli mandaa maa bu nde akiyiisi mu nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo ya ku Kapernawumi.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miyii miasiisi Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Babalayi mu miyii mia nde miakiyuu nde, mialeeli: «Nziisili yi yili ya pasi mu usiingi! Na utuu usiingi?» <verse eid="JHN 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yiisu ali ayiluu uyaaba ti miyii mia nde miaba mu unhunhunyu mu ndaa yii. Ni mu buu nde wabaleeli: «Nziisili yii yimweesi beni pasi mu mitimi? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Ka beni buni dikaasa so dimoni Mwaana a muutu mu uhaata ku yula ku nde ali tsiomi? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Ni Muheebili a Nziaambi li mu uha moonyi. Musunyi a ali na ndutu pe. Mandaa ma me maaleele beni mali Muheebili na moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Ka nha kati a beni uli na bali mu uhele usa me imiini.» Ka bunu, umatuu mu mbaandili, Yiisu ali ayaaba bana bakihele usa imiini na, na kaayeelele nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Nde abwileele: «Ni mu buu me maaleele beni ti, muutu pe wu utuu uyiri kwaa me so, Tata Nziaambi aheeri pe nde muswa mu uyiri kwaa me.» <verse eid="JHN 6:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Umatuu mu taanga dii, balayi mu miyii mia nde basiisi na banyaali ubwadieenge na nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Ni mu buu Yiisu afuuli kwaa miyii kuumi na mioolo: «Beni ka ditooni uyene?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simooni Peetero wamuvutili: «Pfumu, kwaa na bisi diyene? We li na mandaa mali mu uha moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Bisi diasa imiini na diayaaba ti, we ni wuu wa Ngira, wu Nziaambi atsinduu!» <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «A me pe nasoolo beni kuumi na boolo? Ka bunu, mosi mu beni li musiali a Saatina!» <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Nde mu ndaa Yuuda akitsuu, mwaana a Simooni Isikarioti. Mundaa ti Yuuda, so bu nde ali mosi mu miyii kuumi na mioolo, sa ayaluu Yiisu.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ali ku Mukuungi wa Bituru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yiisu akiyene adieenge mu itinini kia Ngalili. Nde ali a atoono pe utaba mangaanda ma Yuuda, mundaa ti bakuutu ba Bayuudayo bakisaa udusu nde. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Mukuungi a Bayuudayo wa Bituru ali ka bebele. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Baana banguu ba Yiisu bamuleeli: «Mata nhana yene ku Yuuda, paa miyii mia we, mio ka, mimono bimaanga bi we li mu usa. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>A uli na muutu pe wu ubaasala mu tsweeyi, mbii ti nde li na nzala ya uyabina kwaa baata. Bu yili ti we li mu uyiluu bimaanga bia pili yii, bubwe we yabina kwaa baata boosi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Mundaa ti, baana ba nguu ba nde bo makulu a bakisa pe imiini mu nde.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «Taanga dia me keni a diafwaana pe. Ka kwaa beni, taanga dioosi koo dimbwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Baata ba tsi a butuu ubele beni pe, ka bo bali na ibelili mu me, mundaa ti me ndi mu uta imbaangi ti, biyiluu bia bo bili bibibi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Beni ni bali, diyene wa beni ku mukuungi. Me a niyene pe ku mukuungi wuu, mundaa ti taanga dia me keni a diafwaana pe.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Nha mbisi a uleele buu, nde asiaali ku itinini kia Ngalili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Ka mu taanga di baana ba nguu ba nde bayeni ku mukuungi, Yiisu ka ayeni kuu. Ka nde a ayeni pe nha kulu a baata, ka mu tsweeyi nde ayeni kuu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Bakuutu ba Bayuudayo bamusiayi ku mukuungi wuu, na bakifulusunu: «Nde kuni ali?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Mutso koongi, baata bakitsuu kwalaa mu nde. Babamosi bakileele: «Nde muutu wu mubwe ali.» Ka babakimi ti: «Pia, nde muutu wu mubi ali, nde li mu udiimbisi baata.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Ka muutu pe so mosi wakitsuu mu nde nha kulu a baata. Mundaa ti bo boosi bali na boomo ba bakuutu ba Bayuudayo.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ayiisi mu nzo a Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Bu mukuungi ali maato nha kati a kati, Yiisu ayeni ku nzo a Nziaambi na abaandii uyiisi. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Bayuudayo bakikimuu na bakifulusunu: «Buni nde ali mu uyaaba mandaa ma Nziaambi moosi, nde wahele uyii?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «A nziisili a me pe me ndi mu uha, ka nziisili a watsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Watoono uyiluu litoono la Nziaambi, sa ayaaba ti nziisili a me kwaa Nziaambi yili mu umata. Na nde sa ayaaba ka ti, me a mu litumu la me makulu pe, me ndi mu utsuu. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Wu utsuu mu kuumbu a nde makulu, li mu usaa buzitu mu nde makulu. Ka wu li mu usaa buzitu ba watsinduu nde, li mu uta ngwanya, na a uli na ndaa ya pia mu nde pe. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Mooso a ahi pe beni Mikele? Ka so mosi pe mu beni li mu usalila mio mu kuulu yafwaana. Mu ima beni dili mu usaa udusu me?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Baata ba mu koongi bamuvutili: «We li na muheebili wu mubi! Na li mu usaa udusu we?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Me ndila imaanga imosi me maayiluu, na beni boosi dili mu ukimuu! <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Mooso aloombi beni mu ukese bibabaana bia babaala. Ka bunu, tumini dii a diamata pe kwaa nde, ka kwaa bamwakaa ba bisi ba tsiomi. Ka bu yili ti ni buu Mooso aloombi beni, beni dili mu usiingi mu ukese muutu mu iluumbu kia saba. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Beni dili mu ukese muutu mu iluumbu kia saba, mu ukiinzi Mikele mia Mooso. Ka mu ima beni dili na kesi a me, mundaa ti me maabeelese muutu wu mubiimbili mu iluumbu kia saba? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Dinyaala ufuundusu ndila mu ma beni dili mu umono mu misi mia beni, ka difuundusu bwafwaana.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koongi yafulisini mbii ti Yiisu ni Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Babamosi mu basi Yeruselemi bakifulusunu: «A ni nde pe wu bali mu usaa udusu? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Dimono: nde li mu utsuu nha kulu a baata, na bo a bali mu uleele ndaa so mosi pe! Helape bakuutu ba bisi bamaayaaba ti ngwanya nde ni Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Ka taanga di Kristo akaayira, muutu so mosi pe kaayaaba kuni nde akaamata. Ka bunu, nde wu, bisi diayaaba ku nde amata.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yiisu akiyiisi mutso lipaanga la nzo a Nziaambi. Nde aloyi: «Aka me, beni diayaaba me? Beni diayaaba kuni me namata? Ka bunu, me a nayiri pe mu litumu la me makulu. Wuu watsinduu me li afwaana ti basa ilimbisi mu nde. Ka beni a diayaaba nde pe. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Me nayaaba nde, mundaa ti, me kwaa nde namata, na nde atsinduu me.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Ni mu buu, bo basiayi ukaanga nde. Ka muutu pe wanayi koo kia nde nha yulu a Yiisu, mundaa ti taanga dia nde ali keni a diato pe. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Ka bunu, mutso koongi baata balaa basi imiini mu nde. Bo bakileele: «Nha Kristo akaayira, nde sa ayiluu biliimbi bia kimi-kimi biavulu bi muutu wu ali mu uyiluu.»<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Bafarisi bayuyi mabakinhunhunyu mutso koongi, mu ndaa a Yiisu. Ni mu buu, banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi, na Bafarisi batsindii bakebi ba nzo a Nziaambi mu uyakaanga Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yiisu aleeli: «Me keni na beni mu mwaana a taanga hoolo. Tumake, me sa yene kwaa watsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Beni sa disaa me, ka a disololo me pe. Ku me kaaba, beni a dituu uyiri kuu pe.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Bayuudayo bafulisini nha kati a bo: «Kuni nde anhana uyene paa bisi dikoono usololo nde? Kwaa Bayuudayo batsaamuu kutso basi Eleene, na ubiti nziisili a nde kwaa basi Eleene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">basi Eleene </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babali mu uta Basi Eleene nha, baata babali a Bayuudayo pe.</char></note>? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Mandaa ma nde aleeli ma, tsutulu ma? “Beni sa disaa me, ka beni a disololo me pe. Ku me kaaba, beni a dituu uyiri kuu pe!”»<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu li mu uyiisi mu ndaa yatala manziali ma maamba ma moonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Mu iluumbu kia mukuungi kia tsieelele, ni iluumbu kiavulu ndutu, Yiisu atemini na aloyi: «So muutu li na nyooto, nyaala ayiri kwaa me, na anywa. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Weti buli mu uleele Mabasonuu ma Ngira: “Wuu wuli mu usa imiini mu me, manziali ma maamba ma moonyi sa mapala mu mutimi a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ezk 47.1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zak 14.8</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Yiisu akileele buu, mu ndaa a Muheebili a Nziaambi, wu babakisa imiini mu nde bakaayaka. Ka mu taanga dii, Muheebili a Nziaambi ali keni a baha pe. Mundaa ti Yiisu ali keni a amonuu pe mu buzitu ba nde.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Nha mbisi a uyuu mandaa maa, baata babamosi mutso koongi bakileele: «Ngwanya muutu wu ni mubili wayaabisi Mooso!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Babakimi bakileele: «Nde ni Kristo!» Ka babakimi ka bakifuulu: «Ngwanya Kristo utuu uba musi Ngalili<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:46">1.46</ref></char></note>? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Mabasonuu ma ngira a mali mu uleele pe ti, Kristo sa aba wa mu likaanda la mutini Daavidi? Na mo a mali mu uleele ka pe ti, nde sa aba musi Betelemi, bula bakidiaala mutini Daavidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sa 7.12</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:1">Mik 5.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:5">Mat 2.5</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Ni mu buu, kabini yakoti nha kati a baata mu ndaa a Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Babamosi mu bo bakisaa ti bakaanga Yiisu, ka muutu so mosi pe wanayi koo nha yulu a nde.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Bakebi ba nzo a Nziaambi babali batsinduu mu ukaanga Yiisu bavutii. Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na Bafarisi babafuuli: «Mu ima beni dihele ubee nde?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Bakebi bavutili: «Keni a diamono pe muutu so mosi wuli mu utsuu weti nde!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Bafarisi bavutili: «Beni ka dimaasiingi mandaa ma nde? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Uli na mukuutu so mosi, so a buu pe, Mufarisi so mosi wasa imiini mu nde? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Ka baata babahele uyaaba mikele mia Mooso ba, basibi bo!»<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Nikodemo, mosi mu Bafarisi, ali nhaa. Ni nde, muutu wakwiyamono Yiisu tsiomi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">3.1-2</ref></char></note>. Nde aleeli kwaa bo: <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«Mikele mia bisi a mili mu ufuundusu pe muutu, kwahele a ukwayuu nde, na uyaaba ma nde ayiluu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:16">Ndi 1.16</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Bo bamuvutili: «Buni, we ka musi Ngalili? Kengese Mabasonuu ma Ngira, na we sa mono ti a uli na mubili so mosi pe, wapala mu itinini kia Ngalili.» <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Tumake, muutu muutu avutii ku nzo a nde.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu asi mukaasa ngaa tsioongili kolokolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Yiisu ayeni ku mulaanda Olive. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Ngwaali a ngwaali, nde avutii ku nzo a Nziaambi, na baata boosi bayiri nha peembi a nde. Nde adiaali na abaandii uyiisi bo. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Bayiisi ba mikele na Bafarisi babeyi kwaa Yiisu, mukaasa mosi wu bo bakaangi mu usoongo. Bo basuusi nde nha kati a kati a baata boosi. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Ninha bo bafuuli Yiisu: «Muyiisi, mukaasa wu bamaakaanga nde mu usoongo. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Mu Mikele mia mubili Mooso nde aha bisi litumu la udusu mukaasa wa pili yi mu mamanya. Ka we, ima we leeli?» <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Bo bamufuuli nduru yii, mu ulebuu nde mweete, paa babaa bwa ufuundu nde. Ka Yiisu abaandini, na abaandii usonuu nha tsi mu muleembi a nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Ka bu bo bahanini mu ufuulu nde manduru, Yiisu atemini, na aleeli: «Nyaala muutu wuli keni a asa masumu pe, nha kati a beni, atete nde limanya la tsiomi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Tumake, Yiisu abwibaandina, na ahami mu usonuu nha tsi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Bu Bafarisi bayuyi buu, bo bayeni wunu nha mbisi a wunu, ubaanduu mu wavulu bukuutu. Nha mbisi a mandaa maa, Yiisu asiaali nde bake na mukaasa wali mu mutele, nha kulu a nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Ninha Yiisu atemini na wamuleeli: «Maama, ninha bo kuni bali? Muutu pe so mosi wu sieembi we?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Mukaasa avutili: «Muutu pe Pfumu.» Yiisu ninha avutili kwaa nde: «Me ka a nisieembe pe we. We utuu uyene wa we. Ka umatuu mu taanga di, a bwasa masumu pe.»]<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ni liyalila la tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yiisu abwileele kwaa bo: «Me ni liyalila la tsi. Wu uduku me, a udiaata pe kutso pimisi, ka nde sa abaa liyalila la moonyi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Bafarisi baleeli kwaa nde: «We li mu uta imbaangi mu we makulu. Ni mu buu, imbaangi kia we ili kia pia.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «So me ndi mu uta imbaangi mu me makulu, ka diyuluu uyaaba ti, imbaangi kia me ili kia ngwanya. Mundaa ti, me nayaaba kuni me namata, na kuni me ndi mu uyene. Ka beni, a diayaaba pe kuni me namata, so a buu pe, kuni me ndi mu uyene. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Beni dili mu ufuundusu mu imuutu. Ka me a ndi mu ufuundusu muutu pe. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Na mbiiti me fuundisi muutu, pfuundisi a me yili ya ngwanya. Mundaa ti me a ndi pe me bake, Taayi watsinduu me li itwaari na me. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Mu mikele mia beni, basonuu ti utuu usiingi imbaangi kia baata boolo weti kia ngwanya. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Me ndi mu uta imbaangi mu me makulu, na Taayi watsinduu me li mu uta ka imbaangi mu me.»<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Bo bamufuuli: «Taayi a we kuni ali?» Yiisu wabavutili: «Beni a diayaaba pe so me, na so Taayi a me. Mbiiti beni ali diyaaba me, beni diakeni uyaaba ka Taayi a me.» <verse eid="JHN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yiisu aleeli mandaa ma moosi, mu taanga di nde akiyiisi mu nzo a Nziaambi. Mbuu yi nde akiyiisi ali bebele na itsuru kia nzo kia busini. Muutu pe so mosi wakaangi nde, mundaa ti taanga dia nde ali keni a diafwaana pe.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yiisu abwileele kwaa bo: «Me sa yene. Beni sa disaa me, na beni sa dikwa kutso masumu ma beni. Beni a dituu pe uyene ku me niyene.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Bayuudayo bafulisini: «Nde nyutu akaadusu? Mundaa ti nde li mu uleele ti, “beni a dituu pe uyene ku me niyene.”» <verse eid="JHN 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Beni baata ba nha tsini dili, ka me, muutu wa ku yula ndi. Beni dili baata ba tsi yi, me a ndi wa tsi yi pe. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Ni mu buu me ndeeli beni ti, beni sa dikwa kutso masumu ma beni. So beni a disiingi pe ti, me ni muutu wu me ndi mu uleele ti me ndi, beni sa dikwa kutso masumu ma beni.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Bo bamufuuli: «We na li?» Yiisu wabavutili: «Ma me ndi mu ubaaleelanga beni umatuu mu mbaandili. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Me ndi na mandaa mavululu ma uleele, na ma ufuundusu mu beni. Ka watsinduu me, li mu uleele ngwanya. Na mandaa ma me nayuu kwaa nde, ni mo me ndi mu uleele kwaa tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Bo a babahili pe ti, nde mu Taayi akitsuu kwaa bo. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Mu taanga di beni dikaanaangila Mwaana a muutu, beni sa diyaaba ti, me ni muutu wu me ndi mu uleele ti me ndi, na me a ndi mu uyiluu ndaa so mosi pe mu ime makulu. Me ndila ma Taayi ayiisi me, me ndi mu uleele. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Watsinduu me li itwaari na me. Nde a asiisi pe me, me bake. Mundaa ti, me ndi mu ubaayiluuwanga taanga dioosi, mandaa ma nde atoono.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Bu Yiisu akitsuu buu, baata balaa basi imiini mu nde.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwanya yili mu uha baata bunyanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yiisu aleeli kwaa Bayuudayo babasi imiini mu nde: «So beni dikangimi mu mandaa ma me, ngwanya beni dili miyii mia me. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Beni sa diyaaba ngwanya, na ngwanya sa yiha beni bunyanga.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Bo bamuvutili: «Bisi dili baana ba Abraami, na bisi kaala a diaba batee ba muutu so mosi pe. Buni we utuu uleele bisi: “Beni sa diba bunyanga?”» <verse eid="JHN 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli! Pasi muutu wu usa masumu, li mutee a masumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Mutee ubaabaanganga wa likaanda mu mwaana a taanga hoolo. Ka mwaana li wa mu likaanda taanga dioosi. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>So Mwaana hi beni bunyanga, ngwanya beni sa diba baata ba bunyanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Me nayaaba ti beni dili baana ba Abraami. Ka beni dili mu usaa udusu me, mundaa ti beni a dili mu usiingi pe mandaa ma me. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Me ndi mu utsuu mu mandaa ma me namono kwaa Taayi a me. Ni mu buu, beni ka diyiluu ma beni dimaayuu kwaa taayi a beni.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Bo bavutili: «Taayi a bisi, ni Abraami.» Yiisu wabavutili: «Mbiiti beni dili baana ba Abraami, diyiluu makiyiluu Abraami. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Ka beni dili mu usaa udusu me, me wu leeli beni ngwanya yi me nayii kwaa Nziaambi. Abraami a ayilii ndaa so mosi ya pili yii pe! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Beni dili mu uyiluu mandaa mamosi na taayi a beni.» Bo bamuvutili: «Bisi a dili baana ba bindwaala pe. Bisi dili na Taayi ndila mosi, ni Nziaambi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yiisu avutili: «Mbiiti ngwanya Nziaambi ali Taayi a beni, beni diakeni utoono me. Mundaa ti me kwaa Nziaambi namata, na mundaa a nde me ndi nha. Me a nayiri pe mu litoono la me makulu, ka nde atsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Mu ima beni dili mu uhele ubahala mandaa ma me ndi mu uleele? Mundaa ti beni a dili mu utuu pe uyuu mandaa ma me. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Taayi a beni ni Saatina, na beni diatoono uyiluu manzala ma taayi a beni. Nde li mudusi a baata umatuu mu mbaandili. Nde ubaabelanga ngwanya, mundaa ti ngwanya a yili mu nde pe. Mbiiti nde li mu uta pia, pili a nde yili buu, mundaa ti nde li ngaa pia, na nde li taayi a pia. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Ka me, mundaa ti me ndi mu uleele ngwanya, beni a dili mu usa imiini mu me pe. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Na nha kati a beni utuu umweese ti me nasa lisumu? Ka mbiiti me ndi mu uleele ngwanya, mu ima beni a dili mu uhele usa imiini mu me? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Muutu wuli wa Nziaambi, koo li mu uyuu mandaa ma Nziaambi ali mu uleele. Ka beni a dili baata ba Nziaambi pe, ni mu buu, beni a dili mu uyuu mandaa ma nde pe.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Bayuudayo baleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Bisi a dili na buungu pe mu uleele ti we li musi Samaria, na we akangama kwaa miheebili mimibi?» <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yiisu avutili: «Me a nakangama pe kwaa miheebili mimibi. Ka me ndi mu ukiinzi Taayi a me, na beni dili mu ubisi ukiinzi me. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Me a ndi mu usaa buzitu mu me makulu pe. Uli na muutu wuli mu usaa buzitu mu me, na wuli mu ufuundusu baata. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli! Muutu wu utumumu mandaa ma me a ukwa pe.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Bayuudayo bavutili: «Nha ka bisi dimaayiluu uyaaba ti we akangama kwaa miheebili mimibi! Abraami akwi, mibili miakwi. Ka we li mu uleele ti wu utumumu mandaa ma we a ukwa pe. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Mu matsimi ma we ti we avulu Abraami wakwa? Mibili ka miakwa. We bu li mu utsimi ti we na li?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yiisu avutili: «Mbiiti me makulu ndi mu umweese buzitu ba me, keni buzitu ba me a bali na ndutu pe. Ka Taayi a me li mu umweese buzitu ba me. Beni dili mu uleele ti “Nde Nziaambi a bisi ali”, <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>ka bunu beni a diayaaba nde pe. Ka me, me nayaaba nde. Mbiiti me naba naleele ti me a nayaaba nde pe, me keniba ngaa pia weti beni. Ka me nayaaba nde, na me ndi mu utumumu mandaa ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Taayi a beni Abraami ali aluulu mu kinyi, ndila mu tsimi ya umono iluumbu kia me. Nde amoni kio na nde ali na kinyi mundaa a kio.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Bayuudayo bamuleeli: «We kaala so maku mataana ma bilimi a atooso pe, ka we amono Abraami?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli! Tswaamina Abraami ubutuu, “me ndi.”» <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Ninha, bo batoli mamanya mu utete Yiisu. Ka Yiisu asweemi na apali mu Nzo a Nziaambi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu abeelisi muutu wabutuu ingimangimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Mu kuulu, Yiisu amoni muutu wali ingimangimi umatuu mbutili a nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Miyii mia nde miamufuuli: «Muyiisi, mundaa a masumu ma nde oo ti mundaa masumu ma bibuti bia nde, nde abutii ingimangimi?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yiisu avutili: «A mundaa masumu ma nde, na ma bibuti bia nde pe, nde a butii ingimangimi. Ka nde abutii ingimangimi paa ti, isala kia Nziaambi imonuu mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Bu yikeni nyanga, bisi diafwaana ukuusu bisala bia watsinduu me. Nha bwisi bukaayili, muutu so mosi pe wu kaatuu usala. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Bu me keni nha tsini a toto nha, me ndi liyalila la tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Nha mbisi a mandaa maa, nde atswiili mate nha tsi, na asi mwaana mutamba mu mate ma nde. Nde akili mutamba wuu nha yulu a misi mia ingimangimi, <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>na wamuleeli: «Yayobo ku idia kia kuumbu Silowa.» Mambiindili ma kuumbu yii: «Wu batsinduu.» Ingimangimi kiayeni kuu, kiayobi, na bu nde ayiri avutuu, nde amoni na yalilaa. <verse eid="JHN 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Bambaayi ba nde na baata babamoni nde bu akiloombo mboongo tsiomi, bafuuli: «Wu a ni nde pe wakidiaala nha tsi na tsi mu uloombo mboongo?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Babamosi bakileele: «Ni nde.» Babakimi ti: «Pia, a nde pe, ka nde afwaanina nde!» Ka nde makulu akileele: «Ni me wa me!» <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Bo bafuuli nde: «Buni misi mia we misiiri mu udibini?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Nde abiindili: «Baala la kuumbu Yiisu maayiluu mwaana a mutamba, nde maakili nde nha yulu a misi, na maalele me: “Yene yayobo ku idia kia kuumbu Silowa.” Me nayeni kuu, me nayobo, na me ndi mu umono!» <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Bo bamufuuli: «Kuni nde ali?» Nde ni avutili bo: «Me a nayaaba pe.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Babiti muutu wali ingimangimi kwaa Bafarisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Kaba, iluumbu ki Yiisu ayilii mutamba mu udibili misi mia nde, ali iluumbu kia saba. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Ni mu buu, Bafarisi ka, bafuuli nde miayilimi paa nde abaanduu umono mu taanga di. Nde wabayali mutata: «Nde akili me mwaana mutamba nha yulu a misi, me maayobo, na mu taanga di me ka mu umono.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Ndaamba a Bafarisi baleeli kwaa nde: «Wu yilii maa a utuu umata kwaa Nziaambi pe, mundaa ti nde ali mu ukiinzi iluumbu kia saba pe.» Ka babamosi bavutili: «Buni ngaa masumu utuu uyiluu bimaanga bia pili yi?» Na Bafarisi bakabii mu makaba moolo. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Bo babwifuulu kwaa ingimangimi kiabeelii: «Aka we, ima we li mu uleele mu muutu wudibili we misi?» Nde ni avutili ti: «Nde mubili ali.» <verse eid="JHN 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Ka bakuutu ba Bayuudayo a batooni pe usa imiini ti, nde ali ingimangimi, na nde ka mu umono. Ni mu buu, bo batumisi bibuti bia nde, <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>na babafuuli manduru: «Ngwanya wuu na wu ni mwaana a we? Beni utuu uleeli ti nde abutuu ingimangimi? Aka buni nde aka mu umono na yalilaa mu taanga di?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Bibuti biavutili: «Bisi diayaaba ti, nde mwaana a bisi na abutuu ingimangimi. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Ka buni nde amaasa mu umono, yii bisi a diayaaba pe! Na a diayaaba pe ka, na maadibili misi mia nde! Fuulani nde: nde a ali pe mwaana ngebe, nde utuu uvutulu beni mamvutu nde makulu!» <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Bo batsuyi buu mundaa ti, bo bali na boomo ba bakuutu ba Bayuudayo. Mundaa ti, bakuutu ba Bayuudayo bali bamaayuhusunu mu ubingi mu nzo a makutunu ma bo, pasi muutuu wu uleele ti Yiisu ni Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Ni mu buu bibuti bialeeli: «Nde a ali pe ngebe, difuulu nde!» <verse eid="JHN 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Bafarisi bati wali ingimangimi mbili mu mbala ya dioolo, na bamuleeli: «Leele ngwanya nha kulu a Nziaambi. Bisi diayaaba ti muutu wuu li ngaa masumu.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Nde avutili: «Me a nayaaba pe mbiiti nde ngaa masumu ali, oo ngori. Ka me nayaaba ndaa mosi: me nali ingimangimi na me ndi mu umono na yalilaa mu taanga di!» <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Bo bamufuuli: «Ima nde amaasa we? Buni nde amaadibili misi mia we?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Nde ni avutili: «Me namaakwaleele beni yo, na beni a diayuu pe. Mu ima beni dili na nzala me bwaleele beni yo? Helape beni ka nzala uba miyii mia nde!» <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Bo bamutuyi na bamuleeli: «We muyii a nde li! Bisi miyii mia Mooso dili. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Bisi diayaaba ti Nziaambi atsuu kwaa Mooso. Ka nde, bisi a diayaaba pe kuni nde amata!» <verse eid="JHN 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Nde avutili: «Mono ndaa ya ukimuu: beni a diayaaba pe nde wa kuni ali, ka bunu nde maadibili misi mia me! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Bisa beni diayaaba ti Nziaambi a ubaayuu pe bangaa masumu, ka nde ubaayuu pasi muutu wu ubaakinzi nde na uyiluu litoono la nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Kaala a diayuu pe ti muutu maadibili misi mia muutu wabutuu ingimangimi. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Mbiiti muutu wuu a amati kwaa Nziaambi pe, nde a keni utuu uyiluu ndaa so mosi pe.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Bo bamuvutili: «We woosi li kutso masumu umatuu mbutili a we, na we a li na ndaa ya uyiisi bisi pe!» Na bo babingi nde ku mbari.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yiisu ayuyi ti babingi muutu wali ingimangimi ku mbari. Yiisu ayimono nde na wamufuuli: «We li mu usa imiini mu Mwaana a muutu?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Nde avutili: «Pfumu, nde na ali? Leele me paa me sa imiini mu nde.» <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yiisu wamuleeli: «We li mu umono nde. Ni nde li mu utsuu kwaa we.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Nde ni avutili: «Me ndi mu usa imiini, Pfumu.» Na nde atsukini nha kulu a Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yiisu ni aleeli: «Me nayiri nha tsi yi, paa pfuundisi yiba: paa bingima-ngimi bimono, na babumono bakituu bingima-ngimi.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Ndaamba a Bafarisi babali nha pele a nde, bayuyi mandaa maa na bamufuuli: «Bisi ka bingima-ngimi dili?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yiisu avutili kwaa bo: «Mbiiti beni diali bingima-ngimi, beni a diakeeba na masumu pe. Ka bunu, beni dili mu uleele ti: “Bisi dili mu umono”, ni mu buu masumu ma beni ni buunabu mali.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ni mukebi a mameme wu mubwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yiisu aleeli: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli! Muutu wu ukoto mutso ihaanga kia mameme kwahele a uyoo nha munywa a ihaanga, ka haati mu ibaa, muutu wuu muyibi ali, nde ipunga-pungu. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Ka muutu wu ukoto mu munywa a ihaanga, li mukebi a mameme. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Mu ndaa a nde, mukebi a ihaanga ali mu udibili ihaanga. Mameme mali mu uyuu muniingi a ndaa a nde. Na nde li mu uta mameme ma nde, pasi lo mu kuumbu a lo, na li mu ubiti mo ku mbari. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Mu taanga di nde ali mu upalisa mo, nde li mu uyene nha kulu a mo, na mameme mali mu uduku nde, mundaa ti mo mayaaba muniingi a ndaa a nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Ka mo a mutuu uduku so hoolo pe muutu wu mo mahele uyaaba. Mo sa mabata la na nde, mundaa ti mo a mayaaba pe miniingi mia baata bakimi.»<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yiisu asialili ifwaani kii mu utsuu kwaa bo. Ka babakiyuu nde a babahili ma nde akileele pe.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli! Me ni munywa a lipaanga la mameme. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Boosi babayiratswaamina me, miyibi na bipunga-pungu bali<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:1-2">Yel 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:2-3">Ezk 34.2-3</ref></char></note>. Ka mameme a mayuyi bo pe. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Me ndi munywa a ihaanga. Wu uyoo mu me mu ukoto, sa avuu. Nde sa atuu ukoto na upala, na sa abaa biloo bia udia. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Muyibi koo li mu uyiri ndila mu uyibi, mu udusu na mu utsala. Ka me nayiri paa baata babaa moonyi, na babaa nde wavululu. <verse eid="JHN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>Me ndi mukebi wu mubwe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:1">Mik 23.1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:11">Yes 40.11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:15">Ezk 34.15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:24">37.24</ref></char></note>. Mukebi wu mubwe ubaayeelele moonyi a nde, mundaa a mameme ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Muutu wuli mu usala ndila mu mboongo, a ali pe mukebi wa ngwanya, mundaa ti a nde a wu baakebanga mameme mu taanga dioosi pe. Mameme a mali ma nde pe. Mu taanga di nde ali mu umono miminzi mu uyiri, nde li mu ubaabwongolo mo, na li mu ubata. Miminzi mili mu ukaanga mameme, na mili mu utsala mukaanga woosi. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Muutu wuli mu usala ndila mu mboongo, na nde a ali na tsoongo mundaa a mameme pe. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Me ndi mukebi wu mubwe. Me nayaaba mameme ma me, na mo ka mayaaba me. <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Bumosi ka Taayi ayaaba me, na me ka nayaaba Taayi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11.27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10.22</ref> </char></note>. Na me ndi mu uha moonyi a me mu mameme ma me. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Me ndi na mameme makimi mamali a mutso ihaanga ki pe. Me nafwaana ubiti mo ka. Mo sa mayuu muniingi a ndaa a me, na mo sa maba mukaanga ndila mosi, na mukebi ndila mosi. <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Ni mu buu Taayi atoono me, mundaa ti me ndi mu uha moonyi a me, mu ubwaholo nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Muutu pe wuli mu uholo moonyi a me, ka mu litoono la me makulu me ndi mu uha nde. Me ndi na litu la uha nde, na me ndi na litu la ubwaholo nde. Lii ni litumu li Taayi a me aha kwaa me.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Bayuudayo babwikabuu mundaa a mandaa maa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Babalayi mu bo bakileele: «Nde akangama kwaa muheebili wu mubi! Nde mubeeri a lari! Mu ima beni dili mu uyuu nde?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Babamosi bakivutulu: «Muutu wakangama kwaa muheebili wu mubi utuu pe utsuu bu. Muheebili wu mubi li na litu la udibili misi mia bingima-ngimi?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bayuudayo batuni Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Bakisa mukuungi a ndibili a moonyi a lisieme la nzo a Nziaambi ku ngaanda a Yeruselemi. Ali ka taanga dia kioori kia mifuri. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yiisu akidieenge mutso lipaanga la nzo a Nziaambi, ku tsini a ipaangala kia Solomo. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Bayuudayo bamudiengilili na bamuleeli: «Natee ki taanga we unyaala bisi kutso kenge-kenge? Ngwanya mbii ti we ni Kristo, leele bisi yo na yaki-yaki.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Me naleeli beni yo, ka beni a dili mu usa imiini pe. Mandaa ma me ndi mu uyiluu mu kuumbu a Taayi a me, mali mu uta imbaangi mu me. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Ka beni a dili mu usa imiini pe, mundaa ti beni a dili pe mu kaba la mameme ma me. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Mameme ma me mali mu uyuu muniingi a ndaa a me. Me nayaaba mo, na mo ka mali mu uduku me. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Me ndi mu uha mo moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. Mameme a mudiimbili so hoolo pe. Muutu pe so mosi wu upatila mo nha koo kia me. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Taayi a me wa aha mo kwaa me, avulu bioosi mu litu, na muutu pe so mosi wu utuu upatila mo nha koo kia Taayi. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Me na Taayi, bisi dili muutu mosi.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Bayuudayo babwitolo mamanya mu utete Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yiisu wabafuuli: «Me nadimweesi mandaa malaa mamabwe mamata kwaa Taayi. Mu ki ndaa mu mandaa maa, ma na yiluu, beni dili na nzala ya udusu me mu mamanya?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Bayuudayo bamuvutili: «Bisi a dili pe na nzala ya udusu we mu mamanya mundaa biyiluu bibibwe bi we ayiluu. Ka mu itari ki we atuu Nziaambi: we muutu li, ka we li mu uleele mu iwemakulu ti we Nziaambi li!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yiisu avutili: «A basonuu pe mu mikele mia beni ti: “Me ndeeli ti, beni banziaambi dili<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Mkg 82.6</ref></char></note>”? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Bisa-beni diayaaba ti a butuu pe umaasa mali mu uleele Mabasonuu ma Ngira. Ka bunu, baata ba mikele mili mu uta banziaambi ni baata babayiisi mandaa ma Nziaambi. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Me, Taayi abiaalisa me, na nde atsinduu me nha tsi. So me ndeeli ti: “Me ndi Mwaana a Nziaambi”, buni beni dituu uleele ti me ndi mu utuu Nziaambi? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Mbii ti me a ndi mu uyiluu pe biyiluu bia Taayi a me, dinyaala usa imiini mu me. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Ka mbii ti me ndi mu uyiluu bio, so beni a dili mu usa imiini mu me pe, disa imiini mu biyiluu bia me. Disa imiini, paa beni diyaaba na dibahala ti Taayi li mu me, na me ndi mu Taayi.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Bo babwisaa ukaanga nde, ka a bamubayi pe.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Yiisu abwiyene ku simi li limosi la nziali ya kuumbu Yorodaani, nha mbuu yi Yowani akibootuu baata. Nde adiaali kuu mwaana biluumbu hoolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Baata babalayi bayiri kwaa nde na bakileele: «Yowani a ayilii pe biliimbi bia ukimuu, ka moosi ma Yowani aleeli mu muutu wu mali ma ngwanya!» <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Na, nha mbuu yii, bo ali babalayi mu usa imiini mu Yiisu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Likwa la Laazaro mbaayi a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Ali na baala limosi labeele la kuumbu Laazaro. Nde ali musi Betania, ni bula ba Mari na Marte, bakeri ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Mari ni mukaasa wayitili mananaasa mu miili mia Yiisu, na wakoombili mio mu naanga dia nde. Laazaro wali wabeele ali keri a nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Baana ba nguu bo baboolo ba bakaasa batsindii muutu mu uleele kwaa Yiisu: «Pfumu, nduu a we li mu ubeele.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Mu taanga di Yiisu ayuyi mukeenzi wuu, nde aleeli: «Ibeeri kia Laazaro a ibiti pe nde ku likwa. Kio sa imweese buzitu ba Nziaambi, paa buzitu ba Mwaana a Nziaambi bayabina mu kio.» <verse eid="JHN 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yiisu akitoono Marte na mwaana a nguu a nde, na Laazaro ka.<verse eid="JHN 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Ka bunu, mu taanga di nde ayuyi ti Laazaro li mu ubeele, nde abwilabisa biluumbu bioolo ku nde ali. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Tumake, nde aleeli kwaa miyii mia nde: «Divutuwani ku itinini kia Yuda.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Miyii miavutili: «Muyiisi, liaalili nha, bakuutu ba Bayuudayo baba mu usaa udusu we mu mamanya! We na nzala ubwavutuu ku?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «Mu iluumbu, uli na manguungu kuumi na moolo, a buu pe? Mbiiti muutu li mu udieenge mu nyanga, nde a li mu ukubu baka pe, mundaa ti nde li mu umono liyalila la tsi yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Ka mbiiti muutu li mu udieenge butsuu, nde li mu ukubu baka, mundaa ti liyalila a lili mu nde pe.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Nha mbisi a uleele buu, Yiisu abwileele: «Mbaayi a bisi Laazaro maala tolo, ka me nde niyasiimbili.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Miyii miavutili: «Pfumu, mbiiti nde tolo ala, nde sa abeeluu.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Bunu, mu likwa la Laazaro Yiisu akitsuu, ka miyii miakitsimi ti nde mu tolo akitsuu. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Ni mu buu, Yiisu wabaleeli na yaki-yaki: «Laazaro maakwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Me ndi na kinyi mu beni mundaa ti beni a diali kuu pe, mundaa ti mu yii, beni utuu usa imiini mu me. Ka tsweendani kwaa Laazaro.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Toma, wubali mu uta «mbu», aleeli kwaa bambaayi miyii: «Tsweendani bisa-beni ka, paa dikwaanani itwaari na Muyiisi a bisi!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marte abahili ti Yiisu ni Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Mu taanga di Yiisu ayito, bamuleeli ti biluumbu ka bina umatuu bubadii Laazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Bula ba kuumbu Betania, bebele bali na ngaanda a Yeruselemi. Bakilometre helape batata bali mu ukabila Betania na Yeruselemi. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Bayuudayo babalayi bali bayiri kwaa Marte na Mari, mu uboondo bo mundaa likwa la keri a bo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Bu Marte ayuyi ti Yiisu akiyiri, nde ayeni mu uyabwaana nde. Ka Mari asiaali ku nzo. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Marte aleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Pfumu, mbiiti we ali nha, keni keri a me a amaakwa pe! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Ka me nayaaba ka mu taanga di ti, bioosi bi we uloombo kwaa Nziaambi, Nziaambi sa aha we bio.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yiisu aleeli: «Keri a we sa asiimbuu mu babakwa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Marte avutili: «Me nayaaba ti nde sa asiimbuu mu babakwa, mu iluumbu kia tsieelele.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Me ndi tsimbilili na moonyi. Wu usa imiini mu me, sa aba moonyi, so nde kwiiri. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Na wu uba moonyi na usa imiini mu me, a ukwa pe. We siiri imiini mu mandaa maa?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Nde aleeli: «Ee-e Pfumu, me nsiiri imiini ti we ni Kristo, Mwaana a Nziaambi, wuli mu uyiri nha tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tsimbilili a Laazaro mu babakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Nha mbisi a uleele mandaa maa, Marte ayeni kwaa mwaana a nguu a nde Mari, na wamuleeli mu tsweeyi: «Muyiisi nha ali, na nde li mu usaa we.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mari amana na uyuu buu, nde atemini mu mawasa na ayeni kwaa Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Kaba Yiisu ali keni a akoto pe kutso bula, ka nde ali keni nha mbuu yi Marte ayibwaana nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Bu Bayuudayo babali mutso nzo na Mari mu uboondo nde, bamumoni mu utemene mu mawasa na upala mu nzo, bo bamuduki. Bo bakitsimi ti nde ku ngili akiyene, mu uyalili kuu. <verse eid="JHN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Mari atoori nha mbuu yali Yiisu. Mu taanga di nde amoni Yiisu, nde ayibwa nha miili mia nde, na wamuleeli: «Pfumu, so we ali nha, keni keri a me a akwiiri pe.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Mu taanga di Yiisu amoni nde, na Bayuudayo babayiri na nde mu ulili, Yiisu amoni ngebe dialaa kutso mutimi a nde, na matsimi ma nde maviinzii. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Nde wabafuuli: «Kuni beni diadii nde?» Bo bamuvutili: «Pfumu, yiri na we sa mono.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yiisu alili. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Ninha Bayuudayo baleeli: «Dimono! Nde ali ngo utoono Laazaro!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Ka babamosi mu bo bakileele: «Nde wadibili misi mia ingimangimi, mu ima nde ahele usa ti Laazaro anyaala ukwa?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Ni mu buu, Yiisu bu abwimono ngebe dialaa ku mutimi, ayeni ku ngili. Yo yali wuru libasootolo mutso manya, na libali badibuu munywa mu manya lilinene. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yiisu aleeli: «Dimaasa manya.» Marte keri a wakwa, avutili: «Pfumu, nde aka utuu upala tsulu, mundaa ti ka biluumbu bina basuusu nde muu.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Me a naleele pe we ti, so we siiri imiini, we sa mono buzitu ba Nziaambi?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Ni mu buu, bo bamaasi manya. Yiisu asiimbili misi ku yula, na aleeli: «Taata, me ni vutulu we matoondo bu we yuyi me. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Me nayaaba ti we ubaayuwanga me taanga dioosi, ka me ndi mu utsuu mundaa koongi yadieengelele me yi, paa bo basa imiini ti we atsinduu me.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Nha mbisi a utsuu buu, nde aloyi mu mifuri: «Laazaro, pala muu!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Muutu waba wakwa, apali, miili na mioo bakutu mu biteendi, na busu bafuu mu tsaanda. Yiisu aleeli: «Dinyangila nde na dinyaala nde ayene.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bakuutu ba Bayuudayo bakuti pfuundu ya udusu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mataayi 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malako 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Bayuudayo babalayi mu babali bayiri kwaa Mari, na babamoni mandaa ma Yiisu ayilii, basi imiini mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Ka ndaamba a Bayuudayo bakimi bayimono Bafarisi, na babaleeli mandaa mayilii Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na Bafarisi bakukii pfuundu a ikuutu kia Bayuudayo, na baleeli: «Ima disaanani? Mundaa ti, muutu wu li mu uyiluu biliimbi bialaa bia ukimuu! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>So bisa-beni dinyaali nde, boosi sa basa imiini mu nde, na basi Loma sa bakoto mu ndaa yi. Bo sa batsala nzo a Nziaambi a bisi na baata ba tsi a bisi!»<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Ka mosi mu bo, wa kuumbu Kayifa, wali mukuutu a banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi mu ilimi kii, aleeli: «Beni a dili mu ubahala ndaa so mosi pe! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Beni a dili mu umono ndaanda a beni pe? Yavulu bubwe, muutu ndila mosi akwa mu toono a baata boosi. Mu yii, baata ba tsi yoosi a bufuu pe!» <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Kaba, a mu inde makulu pe nde akitsuu buu. Ka bu nde ali mukuutu a banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi mu ilimi kii, nde ubili akibili ti Yiisu afwaana mu ukwa, mu toono a Bayuudayo boosi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Na a yali ndila mu ifuumbu ki pe, ka mu uvuutu ka baana ba Nziaambi boosi babatsamuu mu tsi yoosi.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Umatuu iluumbu kii, bo baholi kesili ya udusu Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Ni mu buu, Yiisu anyaali ubwamonuu nha kulu a baata, na nha kulu a Bayuudayo. Nde ayeni ku itinini kiabesene na tsi ya tsata, ku ngaanda mosi ya kuumbu Efrayime, ku nde adiaali na miyii mia nde.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Mukuungi a Bayuudayo wa Paaka ali bebele, na baata babalayi bakiyene ku Yeruselemi, mu utsieemese manyutu ma bo, tswaamina mukuungi a Paaka uto. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Bo bakisaa Yiisu, na bu bo bali mutso lipaanga la nzo a Nziaambi, bo bakifulusunu bo na bo: «Ima beni dili mu utsimi? Nde sa ayiri oo ti a uyiri pe ku mukuungi?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na Bafarisi ali bahi tumini ti mbiiti muutu ayaaba kuli Yiisu, nde afwaana uleele bo, paa bamukaanga.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Mari ayitili mananaasa mu miili mia Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mataayi 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Malako 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Biluumbu bisamina tswaamina mukuungi a Paaka uto, Yiisu ayeni ku bula ba kuumbu Betania, ku Laazaro wu nde asiimbili mu babakwa akidiaala. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Kuu, bamuhi biloo. Marte wamuyilii meese, na Laazaro ali mosi mu babali na Yiisu nha meese. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Mari aholi ndaamba liitere la mananaasa ma ngo tala, mabakamina mu ifulu kia kuumbu nare. Na ayitili mo mu miili mia Yiisu. Tumake nde akoombili miili mia Yiisu mu naanga dia nde. Nzo yoosi yaluuli mu tsulu a mananaasa. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Mosi mu miyii mia Yiisu wu bali mu uta Yuda Iskarioti, wukaayeelele nde, afuuli: <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Mu ima bamaahele uyaluu mananaasa ma, mu makama matata ma mikuti mia mboongo, paa baha dio kwaa bawele?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Yuuda akileele buu, a mundaa pe ti nde li na tsoongo a bawele, ka mundaa ti nde ali muyibi. Nde ali wakikaanga ipokolo kia mboongo dia twaari, na akiyibi di bakilooso muu. <verse eid="JHN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Ka Yiisu aleeli: «Nyaala nde swii! Nde siiri buu, mundaa iluumbu ki bakaalooso me mu ngili. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Beni sa dibaabaanganga na bawele taanga dioosi, ka me, beni a dikaabaanganga na me taanga dioosi pe.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Koongi yinene ya Bayuudayo bayuyi ti, Yiisu ali ku bula ba kuumbu Betania. Bo bayeni kuu, mu uyamono Yiisu. Bo bayeni kuu ka, mu uyamono Laazaro wu Yiisu asiimbili mu babakwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi baholi kesili ya udusu ka Laazaro. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Mundaa ti ali mu toono a nde, Bayuudayo babalayi bakimata mu kaba la bo, na bakisa imiini mu Yiisu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu akoti mu ngaanda a Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mataayi 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malako 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Iluumbu kiaduki, koongi yalaa yali yayiri ku mukuungi a Paaka, yayuyi ti Yiisu li mu uyiri ku ngaanda a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Bo boosi baholi matsiooni, na bapali mu ngaanda mu uyabwaana nde. Bo bakiloo: «Osaana! Nyaala Nziaambi asieme wuli mu uyiri mu kuumbu a Pfumu! Nyaala Nziaambi asieme mutini a Iseraeli!» <verse eid="JHN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yiisu amoni mwaana a puundi na adiaali nha yulu a nde, weti buli mu uyaabisa Mabasonuu ma Ngira:<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>«Aba na boomo pe, ngaanda ya kuumbu Siooni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Mono, mutini a we li mu uyiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">nde adiaala nha yulu a mwaana a puundi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9.9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Miyii mia nde a miabahili pe mandaa maa nhana tsi. Ka mu taanga di Yiisu anaangii mu buzitu, bo balibili moonyi ti Mabasonuu ma Ngira ali mayaabisa buu mu ndaa a Yiisu. Na bakuusi mu ndaa a nde mandaa ma Mabasonuu makileele.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Baata boosi babali na Yiisu mu taanga di nde ati Laazaro mu upala mu ngili, na wamusiimbili mu babakwa, bakileele mandaa ma bo bamoni. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Ni mu ndaa yii, koongi yayibwaana nde: baata bayuyi ti nde ali ayiluu iliimbi kia ukimuu ki. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Mu yii, Bafarisi balelisini nha kati a bo: «Dimono, beni a dituu ndaa so mosi pe: dimono bu baata boosi bali mu uduku nde!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Kwali na ndaamba a basi Eleene nha kati a baata babayeni ku ngaanda a Yeruselemi ku mukuungi mu ukuundu Nziaambi. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Basi Eleene baa baswesii kwaa Filipo, wali musi Betesayida ku itinini kia Ngalili. Bo bamufuuli: «Pfumu, bisi dili na nzala ya umono Yiisu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipo ayileele kwaa Andere, tumake bo baboolo bayileele kwaa Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yiisu wabavutili: «Nguungu yimaato yibakaanaangila Mwaana a muutu mu buzitu ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: libutu la bele limaabwa nha tsi lafwaana mu ukwa. Mbiiti lo a likwiiri pe, lo a libutu pe. Ka mbiiti lo likwiiri, lo sa libutu mbutu diavululu. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Muutu wu utoono idiingi a nde, sa ahelele kio. Ka mbii ti muutu tooni Nziaambi kwavulu utoono idiingi kia nde nha tsi nha, nde wuu sa akebe kio mu moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>So muutu tooni usalila me, nyaala aduku me. Mu yii, musiali a me ka sa aba nha me ndi. Taayi a me sa anaangila muutu wuli mu usalila me.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu atsuyi mu likwa la nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>«Mu taanga di, mutimi a me maaviinzuu. Ima me nileele? Me ndeele ti, “Taata kuulu me mu mapasi ma nguungu yi?” Ngori, mundaa ti ni mu ndaa a nguungu yi me nayiri. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Taata, mweese buzitu ba kuumbu a we!» Mu taanga diina dii, muniingi ayuyini mu mayulu: «Me maamweese buzitu ba me, na me sa bwamweese bo.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Koongi yali nhaa, na yayuyi muniingi wuu yaleeli: «Kii idumu kia nzieri!» Babakimi bakileele: «Tumu a Nziaambi maatsuu kwaa nde!» <verse eid="JHN 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «A mu ndaa a me pe muniingi wuu ayuyini, ka mu ndaa a beni. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Diinadi ni taanga di bakaafuundusu tsi yi. Mu taanga di, Saatina pfumu a tsi yi, sa bamubingi ku mbari. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Mu taanga di bakaanaangila me, mu umaasa me nha tsi, me sa dutu baata boosi kwaa me.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Mu mandaa maa, Yiisu akimweese buni nde akaakwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Koongi yamuvutili: «Bisi diayii mu mikaanda mia mikele mia bisi ti Kristo li moonyi taanga dioosi. Buni we utuu uleele ti Mwaana a muutu afwaana ti bamunaangila? Mwaana a muutu wuu na?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Liyalila likeni nha kati a beni mu mwaana a taanga hoolo. Didiaata bu liyalila likeni nha kati a beni, paa pimisi dinyaala ubwilili beni. Mundaa ti, muutu wuli mu udiaata kutso pimisi a ayaaba pe ku nde ali mu uyene. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Ni mu buu, disa imiini mu liyalila bu lo likeni nha kati a beni, paa beni diba baata ba liyalila.»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Pelili a imiini kia Bayuudayo mu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yiisu amana na uleele buu, nde ayeni na ayisweeme la na bo. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>So bu yili ti nde akiyiluu biliimbi bia ukimuu nha kulu a bo, bo a bakisa imiini mu nde pe. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Mu yii, mandaa maleeli mubili Yeesaya mayeni tsitsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Pfumu, na siiri imiini mu nziisili a bisi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Kwaa na Pfumu amweesi lituu la nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Yes 53.1</ref></char></note>?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Mubili Yeesaya abiindili ka, mu ima baata ba aba utuu pe usa imiini. <verse eid="JHN 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>«Nziaambi maadusu bo misi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Nde maakitisi mitimi mia bo miba miminono.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Nde yilii buu paa misi mia bo minyaala umono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">na paa mitimi mia bo minyaala ubahala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Ni mu buu, bo bali mu uhele ukiinguu kwaa me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">paa me mbeelese bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Yes 6.9-10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Mubili Yeesaya aleeli buu, mundaa ti nde ali amono buzitu ba Yiisu, na nde akitsuu mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Ka bunu, balayi so nha kati a bakuutu ba Bayuudayo, basi imiini mu Yiisu. Ka, mu ndaa Bafarisi, bakuutu baa a bakileele buu nha kulu a baata pe, leeti a babingi bo mu nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Bo bakiyiluu buu, mundaa ti bo bakivulu utoono buzitu bakimata kwaa baata, ka a bakimata kwaa Nziaambi pe.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yiisu aloyi: «Muutu wu usa imiini mu me, a mu me pe nde asiiri imiini, ka mu watsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Wu umono me, moni ka watsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Me nayiri nha tsi mu uyalisa yo, paa pasi wu usa imiini mu me, anyaala ubwaba kutso pimisi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>So muutu yuyi mandaa ma me, na a asialili mo pe, me a nifuundusu muutu wuu pe. Mundaa ti, me a nayiri pe mu ufuundusu tsi, ka mu uyobolo tsi. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Muutu wu ubisi me, na wu uhele usiingi mandaa ma me, bayi mandaa mamufuundusu nde. Ni mandaa ma me makaafuundusu nde mu iluumbu kia tsieelele. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Mu ngwanya, me a ndi mu utsuu pe mu ime makulu. Ka Taayi watsinduu me, atumu me nde makulu, ma me nafwaana uleele na uyiisi. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Na me nayaaba ti, ma nde ali mu utumu mali mu ubiti ku moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi. Mu yii, mandaa ma me ndi mu uleele, me ndi mu uleele mo weti bu Taayi a me aleeli me mo.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu aswayi miili mia miyii mia nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Ali tswaamina mukuungi a Paaka uto. Yiisu ali ayaaba ti taanga dia nde dimaato. Ni taanga dia usiisi tsi yi, na uyene kwaa Taayi. Nde akitoono baba nde babali mu tsi. Nde atooni bo natee manini. <verse eid="JHN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yiisu na miyii mia nde bakidia biloo bia tsitsii. Saatina ali amaakwamenese tsimi ya uyeelele Yiisu, mu mutimi a Yuuda, mwaana a Simooni Iskarioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yiisu ali ayaaba ti, Taayi ali asuusu bioosi nha tso mioo mia nde. Nde ali ayaaba ka ti, nde amati kwaa Nziaambi, na kwaa nde ali mu uvutuu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Bu bo bali nha meese, Yiisu atemini, amaasi ikutu kia nde kia yulu. Nde aholi ilipili kibubaakoombolo maamba mu nyutu, ki nde akuti mu luungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Tumake, nde aloosi maamba mu ikoombo, na abaandii uswaa miili mia miyii mia nde. Tumake, nde akikoombili mio, mu ilipili kiali mu luungu la nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Mu taanga di nde atoori nha kulu a Simooni Peetero, Peetero wamufuuli: «Pfumu, we uswaa me miili?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Mu taanga di, we a li mu uyaaba pe ma me ndi mu uyiluu. Ka bweele we sa yaaba.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Peetero wamuleeli: «Ngori, we utuu pe uswaa me miili!» Ka Yiisu avutili: « Mbiiti me a swayi we miili pe, we a ubwaba muyii a me pe.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Ninha Simooni Peetero avutili: «Mbiiti buu Pfumu, a uswaa me ndila miili pe. Swaa ka mioo na mutswe a me!» <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Muutu wumaayobo, a ali na nzala a ubwayobo pe. Ka helape ndila miili butuu uswaa nde, mundaa ti nde li atsieeme nyutu yoosi. Beni dili diatsieeme, ka a beni boosi pe.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yiisu ali ayaaba muutu wukaayeelele nde. Ni mu buu, nde aleeli: «A beni boosi pe dili diatsieeme.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Nha mbisi a uswaa bo miili, Yiisu abwilwaata ikutu kia nde, na avutii nha meese. Nde wabaleeli: «Beni dili mu uyaaba tsutulu a ndaa yi me swayi beni miili? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Beni dili mu uta me “Muyiisi” na “Pfumu”, beni dili na buungu, mundaa ti me ndi buu. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Ka mbiiti me wuli, Pfumu na Muyiisi a beni, me maaswaa beni miili, beni ka diafwaana uyiluu bumosi bana mu bana. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Me mweesi beni buu, paa beni ka disa weti bu me siiri mu beni. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Mu ngwanya, me nadileeli: musiali a avulu pe pfumu a nde mu ndutu. Bumosi ka, tumu a avulu pe watsinduu nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Mu taanga di, beni diyaabi mandaa maa. Mbiiti beni disialili mo, beni sa diba mu kinyi.»<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>«Me a ndi mu utsuu pe mu ndaa beni boosi. Me nayaaba ba me nasoolo. Ka toono mandaa Mabasonuu ma Ngira mayene tsitsi: “Muutu wu me naba mu ukaba lipa na nde, maakaluu ku yulu a me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Mkg 41.10</ref> </char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Me ndi mu ukwaleele beni yo mu taanga di, tswaamina mandaa muyilimi, paa nha mandaa muyilimi, beni disa imiini ti “me ni muutu wu me ndi mu uleele ti me ndi.” <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: wu uyaka muutu wu me natsinduu, yaki me ka. Na wu uyaka me, yaki ka watsinduu me.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ayaabisi ti Yuuda sa wamuyeelele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mataayi 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Malako 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Nha mbisi a uleele mandaa maa, mutimi a Yiisu aviinzii. Nde aleeli na yaki-yaki: «Ngwanya me nadileeli: mosi mu beni sa ayeelele me.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Miyii miatalisini mio na mio, kwahele a uyaaba, mu na Yiisu akitsuu. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Mosi mu miyii, wu Yiisu ali atoono kwalaa, ali adiaala nha bele a Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simooni Peetero atumi nde mu ufuulu kwaa Yiisu, mu na nde akitsuu. <verse eid="JHN 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Muyii wuu abaandini nha bele a Yiisu, na wamufuuli: «Pfumu, muutu wuu ni na?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yiisu avutili: «Me sa tsubu itsuru kia lipa mu ikoombo. Wuu wu me kaaha itsuru kii, ni nde.» Yiisu aholi itsuru kia lipa, atsubi kio mu ikoombo na ahi kio kwaa Yuuda, mwaana Simooni Iskarioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yuuda amana na uholo itsuru kia lipa, Saatina akoti mu mutimi a nde. Yiisu wamuleeli: «Ndaa yi we li mu unhana uyiluu, yiluu yo mawasa!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Muutu so mosi pe mu babali nha meese, wayaabi mu ima Yiisu akileele buu kwaa Yuuda. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yuuda bu ali mukaangi a ipokolo kia mboongo dia twaari, babamosi mu bo bakitsimi ti Yiisu wamutumi mu uyasuumbu bi bo bali na nzala a bio mu ndaa mukuungi. So a buu pe, mu uyaha bungori kwaa bawele. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Ni mu buu, Yuuda aholi itsuru kia lipa, na nhaa-na-tsi nde apali. Ali ka butsuu.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tumini dinyatii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Nha mbisi a nha Yuuda apali, Yiisu aleeli: «Mu taanga di, buzitu ba Mwaana a muutu bamaamonuu, na buzitu ba Nziaambi bumonii mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>[Na mbiiti buzitu ba Nziaambi bamonii mu nde,] Nziaambi ka sa amweese mu nde makulu, buzitu ba Mwaana. Na nde sa ayiluu buu, mawasa-mawasa. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Baana ba me, taanga ndila hoolo dimaasala me mu uba itwaari na beni. Beni sa disaa me. Weti bu me naleeli yo kwaa Bayuudayo babamosi, me nileele yo kwaa beni ka: “Beni a dituu pe uyene ku me ndi mu uyene<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">7.34</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Me niha beni tumini dinyatii: ditonosono bana mu bana. Beni diafwaana mu utonosono bana mu bana weti bu me naditooni. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>So beni dili na litoono bana mu bana, baata boosi sa bayaaba ti beni dili miyii mia me.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ayaabisi ti Peetero sa wamutunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mataayi 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malako 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simooni Peetero wamufuuli: «Pfumu, we kuni li mu uyene?» Yiisu wamuvutili: «Ku me ndi mu uyene, we a utuu pe uduku me kuu, mu taanga di. Ka mbari we sa duku me.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Peetero wamuleeli: «Pfumu, mu ima me utuu pe uduku we mu taanga di? Me sa ha moonyi a me mu we!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yiisu avutili: «We sa ha moonyi a we mu me? Ngwanya me nileele kwaa we ti, tswaamina tsutsu ukookolo, we sa tunu me mbala tata.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ni kuulu yili mu ubiti kwaa Taayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «A diviinzili mitimi mia beni pe. Beni diasa imiini mu Nziaambi, disa ka imiini mu me. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Uli na mambuu mamalayi mu nzo a Taayi a me. So ali a buu pe, me a nakeni pe uleele beni ti, me ndi mu uyayiluu beni mbuu. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Na mbiiti me ndi mu uyayiluu beni mbuu, me sa yiri avutuu. Na me sa holo beni na me, paa kuu ku me ndi, beni ka diba nha mbuu yii. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Beni diayaaba kuulu yili mu ubiti ku me ndi mu uyene.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Toma wamuleeli: «Pfumu, bisi a diayaaba pe ku we li mu uyene. Buni bisi dituu uyaaba kuulu?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Me ndi kuulu, ngwanya na moonyi. A uli na muutu pe wu utuu uyiri kwaa Taayi, so nde a yoyi pe kwaa me. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Mbiiti beni diayaaba me, beni sa diyaaba ka Taayi. Na, umata mu taanga di, beni dimaayaaba nde, na dimaamono nde.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipo wamufuuli: «Pfumu, mweese bisi Taayi, na sa bukuu kwaa bisi.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Umatuu bele pe me ndi na beni, ka beni keni a diayaaba me pe, Filipo? Muutu wumoni me, moni ka Taayi. Buni we utuu uleele: “Mweese bisi Taayi?” <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>We a li mu usa pe imiini ti, me ndi mu Taayi, na Taayi li mu me? Mandaa ma me ndi mu uleele beni, a mali mu umata pe kwaa me. Ni Taayi wuli mu uba mu me, li mu ukuusu biyiluu bia nde makulu. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Disa imiini mu me, mu taanga di me ndi mu uleele: me ndi mu Taayi, na Taayi li mu me. So a buu pe, disa imiini so mundaa a biyiluu bio makulu.»<verse eid="JHN 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>«Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: wu usa imiini mu me, sa asa ka biyiluu bi me ndi mu usa. Nde sa asa ka so biavulu bunene, mundaa ti me ndi mu uyene kwaa Taayi. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Na bioosi bi beni dikaaloombo mu kuumbu a me, me sa nadiyiluu bio, paa Mwaana amweese buzitu ba Taayi. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>So beni diloombi me iloo mu kuumbu a me, me sa yiluu kio.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilasina la utsinduu Muheebili wa Ngira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Mbiiti beni diatoono me, beni sa ditumumu mikele mia me. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Me sa loombo kwaa Taayi mu uha beni Mubaasili, wukaaba na beni taanga dioosi. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Ni Muheebili wuli mu umweese ngwanya. Baata ba tsi a butuu uyaka nde pe, mundaa ti bo a bali mu umono nde pe, na a bayaaba nde pe. Ka beni, beni diayaaba nde, mundaa ti nde li mu uba na beni, na nde sa abaabaanganga mu beni taanga dioosi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>«Me a nisiisi pe beni, beni bake weti bitsaana. Me sa yiri avutuu kwaa beni. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Taanga hoolo dimaasaala, na tsi a yibwamono me pe. Ka beni, sa dimono me. Mundaa ti, me ndi moonyi, na beni ka sa diba moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Mu iluumbu kii, beni sa diyaaba ti me ndi moonyi mu Taayi a me. Beni sa diyaaba ka ti, beni dili moonyi mu me, na me ka ndi moonyi mu beni. <verse eid="JHN 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>Muutu wu uyaka mikele mia me, na tumimi mio, nde wuu ni watoono me. Wu utoono me, Taayi a me ka sa atoono nde. Me ka sa toono nde, na me sa yabina kwaa nde.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yuuda, a wa Iskarioti pe, afuuli Yiisu: «Pfumu, buni we uyabina ndila kwaa bisi, ka a kwaa tsi pe?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yiisu avutili: «Muutu watoono me, sa atumumu mandaa ma me, na Taayi a me sa atoono nde. Bisa Taayi a me, sa diyiri kwaa muutu wuu. Na bisi sa didiaala mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Muutu wahele utoono me, a ali mu utumumu pe mandaa ma me ndi mu uleele. Na mandaa ma beni dili mu uyuu me mu uleele, a mali mu umata pe kwaa me. Ka kwaa Taayi a me watsinduu me, mo mali mu umata.»<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>«Me ndeeli beni mo, mu taanga di me keni itwaari na beni. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Mubaasili a beni, Muheebili wa Ngira wu Taayi akaatsinduu mu kuumbu a me, sa ayiisi beni mandaa moosi. Na nde sa alibili beni moonyi, mu moosi ma me ndeeli beni.»<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>«Iyeenge me ndi mu usiisi kwaa beni. Ni iyeenge kia me, me heeri kwaa beni. Me a ndi mu uha beni kio weti bu tsi yili mu uha pe. A diviinzili mitimi mia beni pe, a diba na boomo pe. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Beni diyuyi bu me ndeeli: “Me ndi mu uyene, ka me sa yiri avutuu kwaa beni.” Mbiiti beni diatoono me mu ngwanya yoosi, beni diakeni uba na kinyi mu uyaaba ti me ndi mu uyene kwaa Taayi. Mundaa ti, Taayi avulu me mu bunene. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Me maakwaleele beni yo mu taanga di, tswaamina mandaa muyilimi, paa nha mandaa muyilimi, beni disa imiini. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Me a nibwatsuu pe kwalaa na beni, mundaa ti pfumu a tsi yi, li mu uyiri. Nde a ali na lituu so hoolo nha yulu a me pe. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Ka tsi yafwaana mu uyaaba ti me natoono Taayi, na ti me ndi mu uyiluu weti bu Taayi atumu me. Ditemene, dimatani nha mbuu yi!»<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ni muti a viinyi wa ngwanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>«Me ndi muti a viinyi wa ngwanya, na Taayi a me li ngaa tsiee a viinyi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Nde li mu ukese pasi paki, lanambata mu me, na lili mu uhele ubutu mbutu. Ka nde li mu utsieemese pasi paki lili mu ubutu mbutu, paa lo libutu mbutu diavulu bulayi. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Beni diamaakwatsieeme, mundaa a ndaa yi me ndeeli kwaa beni. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Dinambata mu me, weti bu me nanambata mu beni. Paki a lili mu ubutu mbutu mu ilo makulu pe, kwahele a unambata mu muti a viinyi. Bumosi, beni ka a dituu ubutu mbutu pe, mbiiti beni a dinambata pe mu me.»<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>«Me ndi muti a viinyi, na beni dili mapaki. Muutu wu unambata mu me, na wu me nanambata mu nde, li mu ubutu mbutu dialaa. Mundaa ti, kwahele a me, beni a dituu uyiluu ndaa so mosi pe. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Muutu wu uhele unambata mu me, sa badumunu nde ku mbari, weti bu bubaadumunu paki, na nde sa akanya. Mapaki makanya, koo bali mu utolo mo, bali mu udumunu mo ku mbaa, na mali mu unyeenge. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>So beni dinambata mu me, na mandaa ma me mabeeri mu beni, diloombo bi beni diatoono, na sa bayiluu buu mu beni. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Dimono bu buzitu ba Taayi a me bali mu uyabina. Bo bali mu umonuu mu taanga di beni dili mu ubutu mbutu dindayi, na beni dili mu umweese ti, beni dili miyii mia me.»<verse eid="JHN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>«Weti bu Taayi atoono me, ni buu ka me ka natoono beni. Diba kutso litoono la me. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Mbiiti beni dili mu utumumu mikele mia me, beni diafwaana uba kutso litoono la me, weti bu me ndi mu utumumu mikele mia Taata, na me ndi mu uba kutso litoono la nde. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Me ndeeli beni buu paa kinyi a me yiba mu beni, na paa kinyi a beni yiba yakuu. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Dimono mukele a me: Ditonosono bana mu bana, weti bu me naditoono.»<verse eid="JHN 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>«Litoono lavulu bunene li muutu utuu umweese, ni la uyeelele moonyi a nde mu bambaayi ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Beni dili bambaayi ba me, mbiiti beni dili mu uyiluu mi me ndi mu utumu beni. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Me a ndi mu ubwata beni basiali pe, mundaa ti musiali a ayaaba pe mandaa mali mu uyiluu pfumu a nde. Me ndi mu uta beni bambaayi, mundaa ti me maalaa beni mandaa moosi ma me nayii kwaa Taayi a me. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>A beni pe diasoolo me, ka me nasoolo beni. Me maaha beni isala paa beni diyene na dibutu mbutu, na mbutu dididiingi. Mu yii, Taayi a me sa wadiha bioosi bi beni diloombo mu kuumbu a me. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Ni mu buu, ndaa yi me ndi mu utumu beni, ni utonosono bana mu bana.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baata ba tsi yi babeli Yiisu na miyii mia nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Mbiiti tsi yili mu ubele beni, diyaaba ti yo yakwabele me, tswaamina yo yibele beni. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Mbiiti beni ali baata ba tsi, keni tsi yakeni utoono bibili bia nde. Ka beni a dili baata ba tsi pe. Me nasoolo beni nha kati baata ba tsi, na paa beni diba ba me. Ni mu buu, tsi yili mu ubele beni. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Dilibili moonyi mu ndaa yi me ndeeli beni: “Musiali a avulu pfumu a nde mu ndutu pe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6.40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yow 13.16</ref></char></note>.” Mbiiti bo bamaabingisi me, bo sa babingisi beni ka. Mbiiti bo bamaatumumu ndaa a me, bo sa batumumu ka ndaa a beni. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Ka bo sa babingisi beni mu ndaa kuumbu a me. Mundaa ti, bo a bayaaba pe watsinduu me.»<verse eid="JHN 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>«Mbiiti me ali a nayiri pe, na a nali na natsuu pe kwaa bo, bo a bakeni uba na masumu pe. Ka mu taanga di, bo ka buungu pe mu ndaa masumu ma bo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Muutu wuli na ibelili mu me, li na ibelili ka mu Taayi a me. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Mbii ti me a nali nayiluu nha kati a bo, biyiluu bili ti muutu keni a ayiluu pe, bo a bakeni uba na masumu pe. Ka bunu, bo bamoni biyiluu bia me, na bo bali mu ubele me na Taayi a me. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Ka maa mali mu uyilimi, paa mabasonuu mu mikele mia bo mayene tsitsi: “Bo babeli me kwahele a toono<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Mkg 35.19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:5">69.5</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>Mu taanga di Mubaasili a beni akaayiri, wu me kaatsinduu beni mu kuumbu a Taayi, ni Muheebili wuli mu umweese ngwanya, na wuli mu umata kwaa Taayi, nde sa ata imbaangi mu me. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Na beni ka, sa dita imbaangi mu me, mundaa ti beni diali na me, umatuu mu mbaandili.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>«Me ndeeli beni ndaa yii, paa beni dinyaala ubwiisi imiini. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Sa babingi beni mu manzo ma makutunu ma Bayuudayo. Na, taanga dili mu uyiri di babudusu beni bakaatsimi ti, bo Nziaambi bali mu usalila, mu pili yii. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Bo sa bayiluu buu, mundaa ti bo a bayaaba so Taayi pe, so me pe. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Ka me maayaabisa beni yo, paa bu taanga dii dikaato, beni dilibili moonyi ti me nayaabisi beni yo.»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Isala kia Muheebili wa Ngira</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Me a nayaabisi pe beni yo mu mbaandili, mundaa ti me ali itwaari na beni. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Mu taanga di, me ndi mu uyene kwaa watsinduu me. So mosi pe mu beni wuli mu ufuulu me: “We kuni li mu uyene?” <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Ka mundaa ti me ndeeli beni mandaa ma, mitimi mia beni mimaaluulu mu ngebe. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Ka bunu, me ndi mu uleele beni ngwanya: yavulu bubwe mu beni me yene. Mundaa ti, mbiiti me a yeni pe, Mubaasili a uyiri kwaa beni pe. Ka so me yeni, na me sa tsinduu beni nde. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Na mu taanga di nde akaayira, nde sa atungululu baata ba tsi yi, mu masumu ma bo, sa mweese bo libweeye la Nziaambi, na pfuundisi yi Nziaambi a kaa sa. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Mundaa yatala masumu, Nde sa atungululu bo mundaa ti bo a bali mu usa imiini mu me pe. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Mu yatala libweeye la Nziaambi, Nde sa amweese bo matoono ma bo mundaa ti, me ndi mu uyene kwaa Taayi, na beni a dibwamono me pe. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Mu ndaa yatala pfuundisi, Nde sa amweese bo matoono ma bo, mundaa ti Nziaambi sa afuundusu pfumu a tsi yi.»<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Me keni na mandaa malaa ma uleele kwaa beni, ka mu taanga di, beni a dituu pe ukutu mutimi mu uyuu mo. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Ka mu taanga di Muheebili wuli mu umweese ngwanya akaayira, nde sa wadibiti kutso ngwanya yoosi. Nde a akaatsuu pe mu nde makulu, ka nde sa aleele mioosi mi nde akaayuu kwaa me. Nde sa ayaabisa beni mandaa mamafwaana uyira. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Nde sa amweese buzitu ba me, mundaa ti mandaa ma nde akaayaabisa beni, kwaa me makaamata. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Bioosi bibili bia Taayi, bili ka bia me. Ni mu buu me ndeeli ti, “Mandaa ma Muheebili akaayaabisa beni, kwaa me makaamata.”»<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>«Ndili a mwaana a taanga hoolo dimaasaala, na beni a dibwamono me pe. Tumake, mwaana a taanga hoolo nha mbisi a nhaa, beni sa dibwamono me.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Babamosi mu miyii mia Yiisu, mialelisini: «Nde ima ali mu unhana uleele bisi? Nde maaleele: “Ndili a mwaana a taanga hoolo dimaasaala, na beni a dibwamono me pe. Tumake, mwaana a taanga hoolo nha mbisi a nhaa, beni sa dibwamono me.” Nde maaleele ka: “Me ndi mu uyene kwaa Taayi.” <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>“Mwaana a taanga hoolo”, mambiindili mama? Bisi a dili mu uyaaba pe nde ima anhana uleele.» <verse eid="JHN 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yiisu ayaabi ti bo ali na nzala ya ufuulu nde manduru. Ninha nde wabambiindili: «Beni dili mu ufulusunu, mu uyaaba tsutulu a mandaa ma me ndeeli: “Ndili a mwaana a taanga hoolo dimaasaala, na beni a dibwamono me pe. Tumake, mwaana a taanga hoolo nha mbisi a nhaa, beni sa dibwamono me.” <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: beni sa dilili, na beni sa dikoto mu minyoongo. Ka baata ba tsi, sa bayaanga. Beni sa diba mu ngebe, ka ngebe dia beni sa dikituu makinyi. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Mu taanga di mukaasa ali mu ubaa misoongo, nde ubaaba mu ngebe, mundaa ti taanga dia mapasi ma nde dimaato. Ka mu taanga di mwaana ali mu ubutuu, nde li mu udiimbili mapasi ma nde. Nde ubaaba na kinyi yalaa, mundaa ti nde maabutu mwaana. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Ni mu buu, beni ka dili mu minyoongo mu taanga di. Ka me sa bwamonono na beni, na mitimi mia beni sa miba na kinyi. Muntaanga dii, muutu so mosi pe wukaamaasa beni kinyi a beni.»<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>«Bu iluumbu kii ikaato, beni a dibwafuulu me nduru mu ndaa so mosi pe. Ee-e, ngwanya me nadileeli: pasi iloo ki beni diloombo kwaa Taayi mu kuumbu a me, nde sa wadiha kio. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Natee mu taanga di, beni keni a dialoombo iloo so imosi pe mu kuumbu a me. Diloombo, na sa badiha. Na kinyi a beni sa yiba yakuu.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu abiingi nha yulu a tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«Me maa leele beni mandaa maa moosi mu usalila bifwafwani na matsaba. Ka mu taanga dikaayira, me a ni bwatsuu mu bifwaani na matsaba pe. Ka me sa yaabisa beni na yaki-yaki, mandaa matala Taayi. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Mu iluumbu kii, beni sa diloombo ma beni dili na nzala mo kwaa Taayi, mu kuumbu a me. Me a ndi mu uleele beni pe ti, me sa kuundu Taayi mu ndaa a beni. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Mundaa ti Taayi nde makulu atoono beni. Nde atoono beni mundaa ti beni diatoono me, na mundaa ti beni diasa imiini ti me namata kwaa Nziaambi. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Me namata kwaa Taayi, na me nayiri nha tsi. Mu taanga di, me ndi mu usiisi tsi, na me ndi mu uvutuu kwaa Taayi.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Miyii mia nde miamuleeli: «Maamono, nha ka we ka mu utsuu na yaki-yaki, kwahele a usalila bifwafwani! <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Mu taanga di, bisi di maayaaba ti we akwayaaba mandaa moosi, tswaamina bufuulu we manduru. Ni mu buu, bisi dili mu usa imiini ti we amata kwaa Nziaambi.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Nha ka beni diamaasa imiini? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Ka, taanga hoolo dimaasaala, na dio diamaato, di beni dikaatsaamuu. Beni sa dibata muutu muutu ku nzo a nde, na beni sa disiisi me mebake. Ka me a ndi mebake pe, mundaa ti Taayi li itwaari na me. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Me maaleele beni mandaa maa moosi, paa beni diba mu iyeenge, mundaa beni dianambata mu me. Beni sa dimono mapasi mu tsi. Ka dilwaata ibaala! Me maabiingi nha yulu a tsi!»<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu akuundi mu miyii mia nde mioosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Bu Yiisu amani na utsuu buu, nde asiimbili misi ku yulu na aleeli: «Taata, nguungu yimaato. Mweese buzitu ba Mwaana a we, paa Mwaana ka amweese buzitu ba we. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>We aha nde lituu nha yulu a baata boosi, paa nde aha moonyi kwaa baa ba we aha kwaa nde. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Na, moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi, ni uyaaba we Nziaambi wa ngwanya ndila mosi, na uyaaba Yiisu Kristo wu we atsinduu. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Me maamweese buzitu ba we nha tsini a toto nha, bu me mani isala ki we aha me usa. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Mu taanga di, Taata mweese buzitu ba me. Ni buzitu ba me nali na bo nha kulu a we, tswaamina tsi yiba. <verse eid="JHN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>Me maasa ti baata ba we aha me nha tsi, bayaaba we. Bo bali baata ba we, we aha bo kwaa me, na bo batumimi ndaa a we. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Mu taanga di, bo bamaayaaba ti bioosi bi we aha kwaa me, kwaa we biamata. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Mundaa ti, me maaha kwaa bo mandaa ma we aha kwaa me. Bo bamaayaka mo, bo bamaayaba ti ngwanya me kwaa we namata. Na bo bamaasa imiini ti we atsinduu me.»<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>«Me ndi mu ukuundu we mundaa a bo. Me a ndi mu ukuundu pe mundaa baata ba tsi, ka mundaa a baata ba we aha kwaa me. Mundaa ti bo baata ba we bali. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Bioosi bibili bia me, ni bia we, na bioosi bibili bia we, ni bia me. Na buzitu ba me, bali mu umonuu mu bo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Taanga hoolo dimaasaala, na me a nabwasaala pe nha tsi, ka bo nha tsini a toto bali. Me ndi mu uyiri kwaa we. Taata wa Ngira, kebe bo babanambita mu we, we wuli mu me, paa bo baba muutu mosi, weti bu bisa-we dili muutu mosi. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Mu taanga di me nali itwaari na bo, me nakikebe bo mu litu la kuumbu a we, ni litu liwe aha kwaa me. Me nakali bo, na so mosi mu bo pe wadiimbili, nha yulu a wuu wu uyene ku ndiimbisi a nde. Nde afwaana udimbili, paa Mabasonuu ma Ngira mamaayene tsitsi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:18">13.18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 41:10">Mkg 41.10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Ka mu taanga di, me ndi mu uyiri kwaa we. Me ndi mu uleele mandaa ma bu me keni nha tsini a toto, paa bo baba na kinyi a me mu bo, kinyi yakuu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Me maaha bo ndaa a we, na tsi yili mu ubele bo, mundaa ti, bo a bali baata ba tsi pe, weti bu me ka nahele uba wa tsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Me a ndoombi kwaa we pe paa we maasa bo nha tsi, ka mu ukala bo kwaa Wumubi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:13">Mat 6.13</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Bo a bali baata ba tsi pe, weti bu me makulu nahele uba wa tsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Biaalisa bo mu ngwanya. Ndaa a we ni ngwanya. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Weti bu we atsinduu me nha tsini a toto, me ka maatsinduu bo nha tsini a toto. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Me maayeelele nyutu a me yoosi kwaa we mundaa a bo, paa bo ka bayeelele manyutu ma bo moosi mu isala kia we mu ngwanya.»<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«Me a ndi mu ukuundu pe ndila mu bo, ka mundaa baata boosi bakaasa ka imiini mu me, mundaa a mandaa ma bo buleele mu kuumbu a me. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Me ndi mu ukuundu paa bo boosi baba muutu mosi. Taata, nyaala bo baba muutu mosi na bisi, weti bu we li muutu mosi na me, na weti bu me ndi muutu mosi na we. Nyaala bo baba muutu mosi, paa tsi yisa imiini ti, we atsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Me maaha bo buzitu ba we aha me, paa bo baba muutu mosi, weti bu bisa-we dili muutu mosi. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Me ndi moonyi mu bo, na we li moonyi mu me. Ni buu bo bakaaba muutu mosi mu ngwanya, paa tsi yiyaaba ti we atsinduu me. Na, tsi yiyaaba ka ti, we atoono bo weti bu we atoono me.»<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>«Taata, me ndi na nzala ti baata ba we aha kwaa me baba na me ku me ndi, paa bo bamono buzitu ba me. Ni buzitu ba we aha me, mundaa ti we atooni me tswaamina nzilimini a tsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Taata walibweeye, tsi a yayaaba we pe, ka me nayaaba we. Na miyii mia me mimaayaaba ti, we atsinduu me. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Me maayaabisa kuumbu a we kwaa bo, na me sa bwayaabisa yo, paa litoono li we atoono me liba mu bo, na me makulu ka me mba mu bo.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Bakaangi Yiisu na bamubiti nha kulu a nguu a ngaanga wa kuumbu Ane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yiisu bu amani na utsuu mandaa maa, nde asiabii na miyii mia nde ku simi lilimosi la muwiili a maamba wa kuumbu Kederoni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:1">Mlk 11.1</ref></char></note>. Bo bakoti mu luumbu lali mu simi lii. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yuuda muyeelili a Yiisu, ali ayaaba ka mbuu yii. Mundaa ti, Yiisu na miyii mia nde bali na ipfu kia ukukunu kuu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luk 21.37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39">22.39</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Ni mu buu, Yuuda ayeni ku luumbu lii. Na nde abiti mukaanga a masodaare na bakebi ba nzo a Nziaambi, ba banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na Bafarisi bamuhi. Bo bali na bidwaanini, na babiti miindi na bikukunu bia mbaa. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yiisu wali wayaaba mioosi mikaabwiilili nde, asweesii kwaa bo na wabafuuli: «Beni na dili mu usaa?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Bo bamuvutili: «Yiisu musi Nazareti». Yiisu wabaleeli: «Me ndio wu!» Na Yuuda muyeelili a nde, ali atemene nhaa na bo.<verse eid="JHN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Nha Yiisu aleeli ti me ndio wu, bo bavutii mbisi na babwi nha tsi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yiisu abwifuulu bo: «Beni na dili mu usaa?» Bo babwileele: «Yiisu musi Nazareti». <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Yiisu avutili: «Me maaleele beni ti ni me. Mbiiti beni me dili mu usaa, dinyaala babamosi bayene.» <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Yiisu atsuyi buu, paa mandaa ma nde aleeli mayene tsitsi: «Taata, me a maadiimbisi pe so mosi mu ba we aha kwaa me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">6.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:12">17.12</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simooni Peetero wali na mukasa, apalisi nde. Nde ateti musiali a nguu a ngaanga a Nziaambi, na wamukesi litswi la koo kia babaala. Kuumbu a musiali wuu ali Malakusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Ka Yiisu aleeli kwaa Peetero: «Vutulu mukasa a we mu isweehili kia nde. We buli mu utsimi ti me a aninywa pe mbasa ya mapasi yi Taata amaaha kwaa me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat 26.39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mlk 14.36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luk 22.42</ref></char></note>?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Mu taanga dii, mukaanga a masodaare na mukuutu a bo, na bakebi ba nzo a Nziaambi bakaangi Yiisu na bamukuti bibolo. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Bo bakwibiti nde kwaa nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi wa kuumbu Ane. Ane ali buko ba Kayifa, mukuutu a banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi mu ilimi kii. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kaba Kayifa ali aha ndoongi yi kwaa bakuutu ba Bayuudayo: «Yavulu bubwe muutu ndila mosi akwa mu toono a baata boosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-50">11.49-50</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peetero atuni Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mataayi 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Malako 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simooni Peetero na muyii mosi mukimi bakiduku Yiisu. Nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi ali ayiluu uyaaba muyii mukimi wuu. Ni mu buu, bo bakoti mbala mosi na Yiisu mutso lipaanga la nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Ka Peetero asiaali ku mbari, nha bele a munywa a lipaanga. Muyii mukimi wuu, wali wayabina kwaa nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi apali ku mbari a lipaanga. Nde atsuyi na mukaasa wakikebe munywa lipaanga, na tumake nde akotisi Peetero kutso lipaanga. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Mukaasa wuu afuuli Peetero: «We ka a li pe mosi mu miyii mia baala lii?» Peetero avutili: «Ngori, me a ndi muyii a nde pe!»<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Ali na kioori kiavululu. Ni mu buu, basiali na bakebi bali badiaala nha mukoo a mbaa, mu uyoto mbaa. Peetero ka akiyoto mbaa na bo.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi afuuli Yiisu manduru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mataayi 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Malako 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi, afuuli Yiisu manduru mu ndaa miyii mia nde, na mundaa nziisili yi nde akiyiisi. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Me nakitsuu nha kulu a baata boosi. Na taanga dioosi, me nakiyiisi mu nzo a makutunu ma Bayuudayo, na mutso lipaanga la nzo a Nziaambi. Ni kuu ku Bayuudayo boosi bali mu ukukunu. Me a naleeli ndaa so mosi mu tsweeyi pe. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Mu ima we li mu ufuulu me manduru ma pili yii? Fuulu kwaa babakiyuu me, ima me naleele kwaa bo: bo bayaaba ma me naleele.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Mu mandaa maa, mosi mu bakebi bali nhaa, ateti Yiisu mbata. Nde wamuleeli: «Yi mvutu yi we uha kwaa nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yiisu avutili: «Leele me, ki ndaa yimbi me maaleele? Ka mbiiti ma maaleeli, ngwanya mali, mu ima we li mu utete me?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi wa kuumbu Ane, atsinduu nde na bibolo, kwaa mukuutu a banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi Kayifa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peetero abwitunu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mataayi 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Malako 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Bu maa makiyilimi, Simooni Peetero ali ninha, mu uyoto mbaa. Bamuleeli: «We ka a li pe mosi mu miyii mia nde?» Ka Peetero atuni bu aleeli: «Ngori, me a ndi muyii a nde pe!» <verse eid="JHN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Mosi mu basiali ba nguu a bangaanga ba Nziaambi, ali kaanda limosi na muutu wu Peetero akesi litswi. Nde afuuli Peetero: «Me a namono pe we na nde mutso luumbu?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Ka Peetero abwitunu. Nhaa-na-tsi, tsutsu akookili.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bafuundisi Yiisu nha kulu a Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mataayi 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Malako 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Tumake, ni babiti Yiisu kwaa Kayifa, ku nzo a mutumi a Looma. Ali ngwaali a ngwaali. Bababiti Yiisu a bakoti pe mutso nzo. Bo bayilii buu, paa bo banyaala usumuu, na bahama mu uba kutso tsieemini, paa baba na muswa wa udia biloo bia mukuungi a Paaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Ni mu buu, mutumi Pilato ayimono bo ku mbari. Nde wabafuuli: «Mu ki ndaa beni dili mu ufuundu muutu wu?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Bo bamuvutili: «Mbiiti nde ali a ayiluu ndaa yimbi pe, bisi a diakeni uyayeelele we nde pe.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilato abwileele: «Diholo nde beni bame, na difuundusu nde weti buli mikele mia beni.» Ka bo bavutili: «Bisi a dili na muswa pe wa uha muutu tsieembili ya likwa.» <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Maa mayilimi, paa mandaa maleeli Yiisu mayene tsitsi, mu ayaabisi buni nde ukwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">3.14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12.32</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilato akoti mutso nzo. Nde ati Yiisu mbili, na wamufuuli nduru yi: «We ni mutini a Bayuudayo?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yiisu avutili: «We nha leeli buu mundaa ti we makulu tsimi buu, oo ti baata bakimi bamaaleele we buu mu ndaa a me?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilato avutili: «Mundaa ti me Muyuudayo ndi? Baata ba ifuumbu kia we na banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi, bamaayeelele we kwaa me. We ki ndaa mayiluu?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yiisu avutili: «Ipfumu kia me a ili kia tsi yi pe. Mbiiti ipfumu kia me ali kia tsi yi, keni basiali ba me bakeni udwaana, paa bakuutu ba Bayuudayo banyaala ukaanga me. Ka ngori, ipfumu kia me a ili kia tsi yi pe.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Ninha, Pilato wamufuuli: «Mu yii, we mutini li?» Yiisu wamuvutili: «We leeli ti me mutini ndi. Me nabutuu na me nayiri nha tsi mu uta imbaangi mundaa ngwanya. Pasi muutu wuli mu usalila ngwanya, li mu uyuu mandaa ma me ndi mu uleele.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilato wamuvutili: «Ngwanya ni ima?»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Bahi Yiisu tsieembili ya likwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mataayi 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Malako 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Amana na uleele mandaa maa, Pilato ni abwiyene kwaa Bayuudayo ku mbari. Nde wabaleeli: «Me amoni toono so mosi pe mu uha muutu wu tsieembili ya likwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Ka beni dili na ipfu kili ti me ha bunyanga kwaa kori mosi mu mukuungi a Paaka. Beni ditooni ti me ha bunyanga kwaa “mutini a Bayuudayo”?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Bo baloyi: «Ngori, a nde pe! Bisi Barabase diatoono!» Ka bunu, Barabase wuu ali ihaangi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Ni mu buu, Pilato atumi babiti Yiisu na bafiinzi nde bikoti. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Masodaare mamunayi iburu kia matsieende nha mutswe. Bamulwaatisi ka iyungu kiabeenge<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:17">Mlk 15.17</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Bo bayiri nha bele a nde, na bamuleeli: «Bwee la we, mutini a Bayuudayo!» Na bakiha nde mambata.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilato abwipala, na aleeli kwaa baata bali ku mbari: «Monani, me nde nibee kwaa beni nha mbari nha, paa beni diyaaba ti, me a ndi mu umono pe toono ya usieembe nde.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Ni mu buu, Yiisu apali ku mbari. Nde ali alwaata iburu kia matsieende, na iyungu kiabeenge. Pilato wabaleeli: «Dimono muutu me!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Ka mu taanga di banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi na bakebi bo bamumoni, bo baloyi: «Komo nde nha kuruwa! Komo nde nha kuruwa!» Pilato abwileele: «Diholo nde na dikomo nde beni bame. Mundaa ti, mu me, me a ndi mu umono pe toono so mosi ya usieembe nde.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Bayuudayo bavutili: «Bisi dili na mikele, na mikele mii mili mu uleele ti nde afwaana ukwa. Mundaa ti nde aleeli ti nde li Mwaana a Nziaambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Mik 24.16</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Bu Pilato ayuyi mandaa maa, nde abwibaa boomo balaa. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Nde akoti mu nzo na afuuli Yiisu: «We wa kuni li?» Ka Yiisu a wamuhi mvutu pe. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilato wamuleeli: «We li mu ubisi utsuu na me? We a ayaaba pe ti me ndi na lituu la uha we bunyanga, na me ndi ka na lituu la ukomo we nha kuruwa?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «We a akeni uba na lituu so hoolo pe nha kulu a me, so Nziaambi a aheeri we lo pe. Ni mu buu, muutu wayeelele me kwaa we, li na lisumu lavulu bunene na la we.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Umatuu mu taanga dii, Pilato akisaa kuulu ya uha Yiisu bunyanga. Ka Bayuudayo bakiloo: «Mbiiti we heeri nde bunyanga, we a li nduu a mutini Kayisari pe! Pasi muutu wuli mu uleele ti nde mutini ali, li mutaata a mitini Kayisari!» <verse eid="JHN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Mu taanga di Pilato ayuyi mandaa maa, nde abiti Yiisu ku mbari. Nde ayidiaala nha mbata a mufuundisi, nha mbuu yibali mu uta: «mbari ya mu mamanya». Mbuu yii, kuumbu a yo «Ngabata» mu Iebeleo. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Ali helape ka nzanga, mu iluumbu kiatswaamina mukuungi a Paaka. Pilato aleeli kwaa Bayuudayo: «Dimono mutini a beni!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Ka bo bakiloo: «Dusu nde! Dusu nde! Komo nde nha kuruwa!» Pilato wabafuuli: «Beni diatoono ti me komo mutini a beni?» Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi bavutili: «Bisi a dili na mutini mukimi pe, nha yulu mutini Kayisari.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Mu yii, Pilato wabayeelili Yiisu, paa bamukomo nha kuruwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Bakomi Yiisu nha kuruwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mataayi 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malako 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ni mu buu, masodaare babiti Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yiisu nde makulu abiti kuruwa a nde, umatuu ku palili a ngaanda Yeruselemi natee ku mbuu yibali mu uta «mbuu ya iteenge kia mutswe». Kuumbu a mbuu yii mu Iebeleo «Ngolongota». <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Ni kuu ku bakomi Yiisu na baata boolo bakimi itwaari na nde. Mosi ku koo kia nde kia babaala, wunu ku koo kia nde kia bakaasa, na Yiisu nha kati a kati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilato asonii nha yulu a mwaana a bala, na atumi banaa lo nha yulu a kurwa. Nde asonii bisionii bi: «Yiisu musi Nazareti, mutini a Bayuudayo.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Bayuudayo babalayi bataangi bisonii bii. Mundaa ti mbuu yibali bakomi Yiisu ali bebele na ngaanda, na bisionii ali mu Iebeleo, mu ndaa a basi Looma na mu ndaa ya basi Eleene. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Banguu ba bangaanga ba Nziaambi baleeli kwaa Pilato: «A sonuu pe “mutini a Bayuudayo.” Ka sonuu ti “muutu wu aleele ti nde li mutini a Bayuudayo.”» <verse eid="JHN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilato avutili: «Bi me nasonuu, ni buu biba.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Mu taanga di masodaare mamani na ukomo Yiisu nha kuruwa, bo baholi bikutu bia nde. Bo bakabili bio mu makaba mana, na bahi pasi kaba kwaa pasi lisodaare. Bo baholi ka iyungu kia Yiisu kibahele ubaamba umata ku yulu natee ku tsi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Masodaare malelisini: «Dinyaalani ukaka iyungu ki. Ka ditaanani zeke mu uyaaba kio kia na ikaaba.» Maa mayilimi paa Mabasonuu ma ngira mayene tsitsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Bo bamaakabisina bikutu bia me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">bamaata zeke mu uyaaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">na kaaholo iyungu kia me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Mkg 22.19</ref></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ni mandaa maa masodaare mayilii. <verse eid="JHN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Nha peembi a kuruwa a Yiisu, ali na bakaasa ba: nguu a Yiisu, mwaana a nguu a nguu a nde, Mari mukari a Klopasi, na Mari musi Mangadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Mu taanga di Yiisu amoni nguu a nde, na muyii wu nde akitoono nha bele a nguu a nde, nde aleeli kwaa nguu a nde: «Mono mwaana a we.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Tumake ni aleeli kwaa muyii wuu: «Mono nguu a we.» Na umatuu mu taanga dii, muyii wuu aholi Mari mu uba na nde ku nzo a nde.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Likwa la Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mataayi 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malako 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yiisu ali ka maayaaba ti, mandaa moosi mamakuu. Na paa Mabasonuu ma Ngira mayene tsitsi, nde aleeli: «Me na nyooto a maamba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Mkg 69.22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 22:16">Mik 22.16</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Nhaa mwali na lisaanga laluulu mu viinyi la nhanyi. Masodaare matsubi itsuru kia tsaanda yaduu mutso viinyi la nhanyi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Mkg 69.22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:36">Mlk 15.36</ref> </char></note>. Bo bakuti kio nha toso a itsuru kia muti wu bali mu uta isopi. Bo bahaatisi iteendi kii nha munywa a Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yiisu anywi viinyi la nhanyi lii, na aleeli: «Mioosi mimaakuu!» Nde atali ku tsi na asieeli muwuumu.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lisodaare latuli libaanzi la Yiisu mu yoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Ali tswaamina iluumbu kia mukuungi a Paaka. Na kwaa Bayuudayo, a bwali bwafwaana pe ti bamvuumbi baba nha yulu a bakuruwa mu iluumbu kia saba. Mundaa ti iluumbu kia saba kii, ali iluumbu imosi kiavulu bunene mu Basaba boosi. Ni mu buu, bakuutu ba Bayuudayo baloombi kwaa Pilato mu utumu ti, baboolo miili mia baata babakomi. Na mu utumu ka ti, bamaasa manyutu ma bo nha bakuruwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Masodaare mayiboolo miili mia watsiomi wu bakomi nha kuruwa, mbala mosi na Yiisu. Tumake mia waboolo. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Ka mu taanga di bo batoori kwaa Yiisu, bo bamoni ti nde ali amaakwakwa. Ni mu buu, bo a bamubooli miili pe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Ka mosi mu masodaare atuli Yiisu libaanzi mu yoo la nde. Na nhaa-na-tsi, makili na maamba mapali.<verse eid="JHN 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Muutu wamoni mandaa maa, ati imbaangi mu mo, na imbaangi kia nde ili kia ngwanya. Nde ayaaba ti nde li mu uta ngwanya, paa beni ka disa imiini<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">20.31</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Mundaa ti, maa moosi mamaayilimi paa Mabasonuu ma Ngira mayene tsitsi: «A buboolo nde muyisi so mosi pe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Pal 12.46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Lit 9.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:21">Mkg 34.21</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Na mukaanda mukumi wa Mabasonuu ma Ngira, li mu ubwaleele ti: «Bo sa basumu misi mia bo nha yulu a muutu wu bo bamaatulu libaanzi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak 12.10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Basuusi nyutu a Yiisu mu ngili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mataayi 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malako 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Nha mbisi a nhaa, Yoosefi musi ngaanda ya Arimate, ayiloombo muswa kwaa Pilato wa uholo nyutu a Yiisu. Yoosefi wu ka ali muyii a Yiisu, ka mu tsweeyi, mundaa ti nde ali na boomo ba bakuutu ba Bayuudayo. Pilato wamuhi muswa wa uholo nyutu a Yiisu. Ni mu buu, Yoosefi ayimaasa nyutu a Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nikodemo wali wayimono Yiisu butsuu, ayiri ka. Nde abeyi helape maku matata ma bakilo ba mananaasa, mabayiluu mu miire na aloweese. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Yoosefi na Nikodemo baholi nyutu a Yiisu, na badii yo kutso matsaanda ma liino. Bo bayitili maari ma mananaasa, weti buli ipfu kia Bayuudayo nha bubaadii bamvuumbi ba bo. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Nha mbuu yi bakomi Yiisu, ali na luumbu. Na mutso luumbu lii, ali na ngili mosi yinyatii. Ali keni a badii pe mvuumbi so mosi mutso ngili yii. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Bu yali iluumbu kia nzilimini a mukuungi a Paaka, na bu yali ti ngili bebele, bo basuusi nyutu a Yiisu muu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Tsimbilili a Yiisu mu babakwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mataayi 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Malako 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Ngwaali a ngwaali mu iluumbu kia limiingi, ku makia ma busi, Mari musi Mangadala ayeni ku ngili. Nde amoni ti manya lali lafuu munywa a ngili, ali bamaamaasa. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Ni mu buu, nde ayeni mu tiini kwaa Simooni Peetero na muyii mukimi wu Yiisu akitoono. Nde aleeli kwaa bo: «Bamaamaasa nyutu a Pfumu mu ngili a nde, na a diayaaba pe nhani bamaasuusu yo.»<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Peetero na muyii mukimi wuu bayeni ku ngili. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Bo baboolo bayeni mu matiini. Ka muyii mukimi wu avuli Peetero mu tiini, na akwito watsiomi ku ngili. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Nde abaandini mu umono, na amoni matsaanda ma liino bali basuusu nhaa. Ka nde a akoti pe. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simooni Peetero wakiyiri nha mbisi a nde, atoori na akoti mu ngili. Nde amoni matsaanda ma liino basuusu nha tsi. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Nde amoni ka tsaanda yibali badii mutswe a Yiisu. Tsaanda yii a yali pe mbuu mosi na matsaanda ma liino. Ka yo ali bafutuu, basuusu nha tata, nha mbuu kimi. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Mu taanga dii, muyii mukimi wuu, watoori wa tsiomi ku ngili, akoti ka. Nde amoni na asi imiini. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Ka miyii ali keni a miabahala pe mandaa Mabasonuu ma Ngira, mali mu uleele ti Yiisu afwaana mu usiimbuu mu babakwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:10">Mik 16.10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Tumake, miyii mio miamioolo miavutii ku manzo ma bo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu amonii kwaa Mari musi Mangadala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mataayi 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Malako 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Mari ali atemene ku mbari, nha bele a ngili, na akilili. Bu nde akilili, nde abaandini mu umono kutso ngili. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Nde amoni batumu ba Nziaambi boolo, balwaata bikutu biahembuu, na badiaala nha mbuu yibali basuusu nyutu a Yiisu. Mosi ali adiaala nha mbuu yali mutswe a Yiisu, na wunu nha yali miili mia nde. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Batumu ba Nziaambi bafuulu kwaa Mari: «Maama, mu ima we li mu ulili?» Nde wabavutili: «Bamaamaasa Pfumu a me, na me a nayaaba pe kuni bamaasuusu nde.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Amana na uleele buu, nde asieetii na amoni Yiisu ali atemene nhaa. Ka nde a akiyaaba pe ti wuu ali Yiisu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yiisu wamufuuli: «Maama, mu ima we li mu ulili? We na li mu usaa?» Mari bu akitsimi ti wu ali musiali a luumbu lii, nde wamuleeli: «Taata, mbiiti we maamaasa nde, leele me kuni we suusi nde. Na me sa yaholo nde.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yiisu wamuleeli: «Mari!» Mari asieetii kwaa nde, na aleeli mu Iebeleo: «Rabuni!» mbiindili ti «Muyiisi!» <verse eid="JHN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Akaanga me pe, mundaa ti me keni a nahaata pe kwaa Taayi. Ka yene kwaa baana ba nguu ba me, na leele bo ti “Me ndi mu uhaata kwaa Taayi a me, wuli ka Taayi a beni; na kwaa Nziaambi a me, wuli ka Nziaambi a beni.”» <verse eid="JHN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Ni mu buu, Mari musi Mangadala ayeni kwaa miyii, na wabayaabisi: «Me maamono Pfumu!» Na nde wabayaabisi mandaa ma Yiisu wamuleeli.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu amonii kwaa miyii mia nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mataayi 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malako 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Tsitsii a iluumbu kia limiingi kii na kii, miyii miali miakukunu mutso nzo mosi. Bo bali babiinduu nzo mu tsiafi, mundaa ti bo bali na boomo ba bakuutu ba Bayuudayo. Yiisu ayiri, na atemini nha kati a kati a bo. Nde wabaleeli: «Iyeenge kwaa beni!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Nha mbisi a uleele buu, nde wabamweesi mioo mia nde, na libaanzi la nde. Miyii mialuuli mu kinyi bu bo bamoni Pfumu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Iyeenge kwaa beni! Weti bu Taayi atsinduu me, me ka nitsinduu beni.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Nha mbisi a uleele ndaa yii, nde afuli bo mupepe, na wabaleeli: «Diyaka Muheebili wa Ngira! <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Baa ba beni dikaasa masumu ma bo kolokolo, Nziaambi sa asa bo kolokolo. Ba beni dikaabisi usa kolokolo, Nziaambi a usa bo kolokolo pe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18.18</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu amonii kwaa Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Toma, ali mosi mu miyii kuumi na mioolo, wubahi kuumbu ya ubili <char style="em">Mbu</char>. Nde a ali pe itwaari na bo nha Yiisu ayiri. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Miyii mimimosi mialeeli kwaa nde: «Bisi dimaamono Pfumu.» Ka Toma avutili: «Mbiiti me a moni pe ikiri kia tsootso mu mioo mia nde, me a nisa pe imiini. Mbiiti me a ndoosi pe muleembi a me nha mbuu yaba tsootso, na koo kia me mu libaanzi la nde, me a nisa pe imiini.»<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Limiingi limosi nha mbisi a nhaa, miyii mia Yiisu ali miabwikukunu mutso nzo. Na Toma ka ali itwaari na bo. Ka bu bo bali babiinduu nzo mu tsiafi, Yiisu ayiri, na atemini nha kati a kati a bo. Nde aleeli: «Iyeenge kwaa beni!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Tumake, nde aleeli kwaa Toma: «Sa muleembi a we nha, na mono mioo mia me. Bee koo kia we, na sa kio nha libaanzi la me. A bwabisi pe mu usa imiini, ba muutu ngaa imiini!» <verse eid="JHN 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Toma wamuvutili: «Pfumu a me, na Nziaambi a me!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yiisu abwileele: «Mundaa bu we moni me, we siiri imiini? Kinyi kwaa baata babahele umono, ka basa imiini<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:8">1Pe 1.8</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yiisu abwiyiluu biliimbi bikimi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:11">2.11</ref></char></note> bia ukimuu, nha kulu a miyii mia nde. Biliimbi bii, a batsuu pe mu bio mu mukaanda wu. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Ka mandaa mabasonuu mu mukaanda wu, basonuu mo paa beni disa imiini ti Yiisu ni Kristo, Mwaana a Nziaambi. Na, bu beni disa imiini, beni sa dibaa moonyi mu kuumbu a nde.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yiisu amonii kwaa miyii mia nde ku mukoo a diaanga la Tiberiade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Nha mbisi a mwaana biluumbu, Yiisu abwimonuu kwaa miyii mia nde, ku mukoo a diaanga la Tiberiade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">diaanga la Tiberiade </char><char style="ft" closed="false">diaanga la Ngalili.</char></note>. Mono bu nde amonii kwaa bo: <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simooni Peetero, Toma wu baha kuumbu ya ubili <char style="em">Mbu</char>, Natanaeli musi Kaana mu itinini kia Ngalili, baana a Zebedaayi, na miyii mia Yiisu mioolo mikimi bali itwaari. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simooni Peetero wabayaabisi: «Me ndi mu uyene ku ulobo.» Bo bamuleeli: «Bisi ka na we diyene.» Bo boosi bayeni na bakoti mu bootu. Ka butsuu baa, bo a babayi tswi so mosi pe. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Busi bu babaandii ukia, Yiisu ali atemene nhaa, nha simi la diaanga. Ka miyii a miayaabi pe ti wuu ali nde. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «Banduu ba me, beni utuu ubaa iloo kia udia?» Bo bavutili: «Pia, bisi a dili na iloo pe!» <verse eid="JHN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «Didumunu siele mu maamba, ku koo kia bootu kia babaala, na beni sa dibaa batswi.» Bo badumini siele, na a bali abwatuu pe udutu lo mu upalisa lo mu maamba, mundaa ti lo ali lamaaluulu mu batswi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:4-7">Luk 5.4-7</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Mu taanga dii, muyii wu Yiisu akitoono aleeli kwaa Peetero: «Wu ni Pfumu!» Bu Peetero ayuyi ndaa yii ti wu ni Pfumu, nde alwaati ikutu kia nde kia yulu, mundaa ti nde a ali na ikutu pe. Nde abwi mu maamba. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Miyii mikimi miayiri mu bootu, mu uyiri adutu siele laluulu mu batswi. Bo a bali pe ngo la na simi. Bo ali taka na simi mu iteesi kia bameetere helape kama. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Nha bo batoori nha simi, bo bamoni mbaa ya makala na batswi nha yulu, na bo bamoni ka mapa nha peembi. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «Dibee ndaamba a batswi ba beni dimaabaa.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simooni Peetero akoti mu bootu, na aduti tee nha tsi, siele laluulu mu batswi babanene. Litaanga la batswi mutso siele ali kama maku mataana na batswi batata (153) mu boosi. Ka so mu litaanga lii loosi, siele a lakikii pe. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yiisu wabaleeli: «Diyiri diyadia.» So mosi pe mu miyii wayesini ufuulu nde: «We na li?» Mundaa ti bo ali bayaaba ti wuu ali Pfumu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yiisu aswesii kwaa bo, nde aholi lipa na wabakabi lo. Nde ayilii bumosi ka mu tswi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Yii ali mbala ya mutata yi Yiisu amonii kwaa miyii mia nde, umatuu bu nde asiimbii mu babakwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu ahi Peetero isala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Nha mbisi a udia, Yiisu aleeli kwaa Simooni Peetero: «Simooni, mwaana a Yowani, we atoono me kwavulu baa-na-ba?» Nde avutili: «Ee-e Pfumu, we ayaaba ti me natoono we.» Yiisu wamuleeli: «Kebe mameme ma me.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Yiisu wamufuuli mu mbala ya dioolo: «Simooni, mwaana a Yowani, we atoono me?» Simooni avutili: «Ee-e Pfumu, we ayaaba ti me natoono we.» Yiisu wamuleeli: «Kebe mameme ma me.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Yiisu wamufuuli mu mbala ya mutata: «Simooni, mwaana a Yowani, we atoono me?» Peetero amoni ngebe bu Yiisu wamufuuli mu mbala ya mutata: «We atoono me?» Na nde avutili: «Pfumu, we ayaaba mandaa moosi. We ayaaba ti me natoono we!» Yiisu abwileele: «Kebe mameme ma me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:28">Biy 20.28</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:2">1Pe 5.2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Mu ngwanya, me nileele kwaa we: nha we ali mufuru, we makulu akikutu kobo a we, na akiyene pasi ku we atoono. Ka nha we kaanunu, we sa sibili mioo, na muutu mukimi sa akutu kobo a we, na sa abiti we ku we ahele utoono uyene.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Mu mandaa maa, Yiisu akiyaabisa buni Peetero akaakwa, na uha buzitu kwaa Nziaambi mu likwa lii. Tumake, Yiisu wamuleeli: «Duku me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:43">Yow 1.43</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu na muyii wu nde akitoono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Peetero asieetii, na amoni muyii wu Yiisu akitoono mu uduku bo. Ni muyii wabaandini nha bele a Yiisu nha bo bakidia, mu ufuulu nde: «Pfumu, na kaayeelele we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:25">13.25</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Bu Peetero wamumoni, nde aleeli kwaa Yiisu: «Pfumu, aka nde, mima mikaabwiilili nde?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yiisu wamuvutili: «Mbiiti me tooni ti nde aba moonyi natee bu me niyiri avutuu, ndaa a we nhani yili? We duku me ndili!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Ubaanduu iluumbu kii, mvuungu a ndaa yii yatsiaamii nha kati a bangaa imiini ti, muyii wuu a ukwa pe. Ka bunu, Yiisu a aleeli pe kwaa Peetero ti, muyii wuu a ukwa pe. Ka Yiisu ali aleeli: «Mbiiti me tooni ti nde aba moonyi natee bu me niyiri avutuu, ndaa a we nhani yili?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Ni muyii me wuu li mu uta imbaangi mu mandaa maa, na wumaasonuu mo. Na bisi diayaaba ti imbaangi kia nde ili kia ngwanya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:35">19.35</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Uli na mandaa makimi mamalayi ma Yiisu ayilii. Ka mbiiti busonuu mo mosi na mosi mu mikaanda, me nitsimi ti tsi yoosi sa yiba yikee mu uswee mikaanda mibakeni usonuu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:30">20.30</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
